	//World Map Tokens
	"WorldMapScrollHouseName": "Tilly's House",
	"WorldMapShopName": "Tilly's Tea Shop",
	"WorldMapShopDesc": "Open between 9:00 AM and 5:00 PM.",

	//Boxosoup Bday
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.boxosoup.birthday_birthday": "$1Happy birthday, @! Do you feel any older?#$b#$16I always feel the same age until about halfway into the year.#$b#$1Anyway, I hope you enjoy your day, and this cake I baked!",

	//Rainy 
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Rainy": "$16I don't really like rain, but the pitter patter helps me fall asleep.#$e#$1Plus, I don't have to water my plants!#$b#$16You understand that better than anyone.",
	
	//Gift Taste
	"Wem.Bundle.GiftTaste.Tilly.love": "$1Oh. This is lovely, thank you so much.",
	"Wem.Bundle.GiftTaste.Tilly.like": "$16Thanks, you're sweet.",
	"Wem.Bundle.GiftTaste.Tilly.dislike": "$17Please don't give me this again.",
	"Wem.Bundle.GiftTaste.Tilly.hate": "Why would you give this to me?",
	"Wem.Bundle.GiftTaste.Tilly.neutral": "$16Thanks.",
	
	//Regular Dialogue
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Engaged": "$24Is this...what I think it is?#$b#$25I don't even know what to say! I never thought...#$b#$26Yes, of course I'll marry you!#$b#$4I can't wait, @.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly0": "$4Honestly, I'm nervous. Marriage is a huge step.#$b#$26But I'm also happier than I've ever been!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly1": "$4I can't wait to meet you at the altar.#$b#$26Are you sure you're ready for forever with me?",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Introduction": "Oh, hello. You must be the new farmer Penny told me about.#$e#$8Hm? Oh, I'm Tilly. I work part-time at the Museum. Bye now.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.breakUp": "$19You're...why? Was it something I did?#$e#$23Just get out of my face! Don't come around, and don't talk to me!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.divorced": "%Tilly is ignoring you. Serves you right.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.DumpsterDiveComment": "$3@...seriously? Don't talk to me again until you've taken a shower.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.HitBySlingshot": "$5OWW! What is WRONG with you?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.GreenRain": "$7I hope this rain won't hurt my plants. And I hope I get to go home soon.#$b#$1Although three meals at Gus's doesn't sound too bad, and I can just read all day.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.GreenRain_2": "$11I don't have to water my crops AND they grow faster?#$b#$0We should have this every day.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Fair_Judged_PlayerLost_PurpleShorts": "%Tilly is doubled-over laughing and can't seem to stop. Best to leave her alone for now.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Fair_Judged_PlayerWon": "$1Congrats, @! Your display was great!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.FlowerDance_Accept_Spouse": "$11You should dip me this year, babe. We'll steal the show!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.FlowerDance_Accept": "$6Oh! Sure, I'll dance with you. I hope I don't forget the steps.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.FlowerDance_Decline": "$8Um, no thanks. We're not really close like that, don't you think?",


	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Mon": "%Tilly is distracted and humming a tune to herself.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Mon2": "$3Ugh, I hate living in front of JojaMart.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Mon4": "Tomato has been extra vocal this week.#$b#$1He's just the best. My rotund little vegetabird.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 20",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Mon6.1": "I guess one good thing about working part-time is having more time for my hobbies.#$e#I really want to start a small, online shop for my custom-bound books.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Mon6.2": "$9I think my roots need a touch-up.#$b#$16Bleaching hair is not for the weak.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Mon8": "Let me tell you a secret.#$e#$0...#$b#$1Just kidding! I want to be cool and mysterious.#$e#$21We are NOT close friends! Take that back.#$b#$1Ok fine. You know a lot about me.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Mon10": "$1That shirt looks great on you, @.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Tue": "$9What should I have today? Green tea...a nice chai latte...Maybe I’ll have a London Fog...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Tue2": "$8I should plant some tulips. Or maybe blue jazz?#$b#$0I like both, but I don't have the space.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Tue4": "$8It's nice of Pierre to let me look at his catalogue even though I usually don't buy anything.#$b#$1I might've guilted him into it.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Tue6": "$8People tell me constantly to wear brighter colours.#$e#$3I wish they'd shut up.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Tue8": "I brewed you some tea. Guess the secret ingredient![(O)614]",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Tue10": "%You catch Tilly staring at you. She turns away with a blush on her face.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 60",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Wed": "$8Um, hi.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Wed2": "$3Pierre's is expensive, but it's not Joja, so!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Wed4.1": "$13Hold on...just cleaning my glasses.#$b#$12Anyway.#$b#$1What's up?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Wed4.2": "$8I was tossing and turning so much last night.#$b#$9I’ll need to sleep earlier tonight to make up for it.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Wed6": "Sam tried to teach me a skateboard trick.#$b#$16I can only be glad that I didn't scrape my knee, or break a bone.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Wed8": "$16I wish I had a dog. I don't think I have the space for it though.#$e#$1Hey, what if we co-parented one?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Wed10": "Tomato has accepted you as a second parent, he told me.#$b#$1Well you're just going to have to believe me!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Thu": "$8Are my braids okay? They feel kind of funny today...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Thu2": "Do you think I can read 10 more books by the end of the season?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Thu4": "$15AHH! A bee!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 16#$e#$9Nevermind, false alarm.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Thu6": "$3Do you know how much self-restraint it takes not to kick that vending machine in the Saloon?#$e#I hold back for Gus.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Thu8": "$1Hey, wanna grab dinner at Gus's tomorrow?#$b#$16I just can't be bothered to cook sometimes.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Thu10": "$11Penny said we're cute together. I agree.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Fri": "Hi, @.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Fri2": "Don't recommend those self-empowerment books to me. They're just a little too corny.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Fri4": "$8Alex introduced himself as 'Josh' when I first moved here.#$b#$0He got really flustered. Don't know what that's about.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Fri6": "Be honest, do you like my white hair?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Fri8": "Honestly, I go to the Saloon on Fridays because I get FOMO.#$b#$11I mean, sooo many crazy things happen!#$b#$8Especially between Marnie and Lewis, if you happen to walk by them...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Fri10": "Hey, cutie.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Sat": "$7Did I turn off the kettle?#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 8",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Sat2": "I need to get some more seeds for Tomato.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Sat4": "$9I know honeybees won't sting me, but that stinger is an omnipresent threat.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Sat6": "$1Evelyn has shared some of her recipes with me. I'm really grateful!#$b#$8Although Alex now bugs me to bake for him when Evelyn won't.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Sat8": "It's days like this that actually made me glad I moved to Pelican Town.#$e#$1Don't tell me going bankrupt was a good thing though.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Sat10": "$3Mayor Lewis not-so-subtly suggested I be mindful of PDA.#$b#$1Give me a kiss! I'm fueled by spite.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Sun": "I need a bigger house. With a bigger library.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Sun2": "$y 'What's your favourite book genre?_Romantasy_Hmm, that one's not my favourite._Mystery_Ooh, I do love a good mystery novel._Science fiction._I like some of those._I don't read._Boooo, I'll make a list of suggestions.'",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Sun4": "$9I like Emily, but I've never gotten close with Haley.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Sun6": "How's the farm, @?#$e#$3What do you mean I'm so friendly today? I'm friendly allll the time!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Sun8": "$6I'm not really good at making friends.#$b#$16Maru has been patient with me. It's not that we never got along, it just felt awkward for a long time.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Sun10": "%Tilly picks an eyelash off your cheek.",
	
	"Tilly.spring_7": "$1It's almost Lunar New Year!#$b#$16I'm going to be cooking and baking all night.",


	//Summer
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Mon": "I had to take my gloves and shawl off. It's too hot.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Mon2": "I lost my scissors...again!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12#$e#$3I bet they're in my couch cushions.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Mon4": "You think I could get a full tour of your farm sometime?#$b#$1I'd love to feed the cows!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Mon6": "Maybe sometime I'll show you my spoon collection.#$e#$3Yes, spoons. Don't make fun!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Mon8": "I'm not really excited for my birthday. It's always a let-down.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Mon10": "Wanna cool off together at the beach?$1",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Tue": "I always forget when Alex opens his ice cream stand.#$e#$1It's a good thing I can see it from my yard.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Tue2": "I like coffee, but it makes me jittery.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Tue4": "Yeah, I get ice cream right after working out.#$b#$1So what?#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Tue6": "It took a lot of convincing to get Seb to take me on motorcycle rides.#$b#$1I have to rebraid my hair afterwards, but it's so fun!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Tue8": "I think I need a new bikini. My current one shrank or something.#$b#$1Or maybe my ice cream habit is catching up to me!#$e#$11Worth it.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Tue10": "$7Be careful in those mines...I worry about you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Wed": "$7Bees...bees...so many bees.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Wed2": "$9Alex talks about gridball...a lot.#$b#$8And working out.#$b#$8And eggs...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Wed4": "$d joja#$3I've thought about egging Jojamart. Maybe even Morris.|$1I egged Jojamart once. Don't tell anyone.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Wed6": "I talk to Tomato a lot at home.#$b#$16I swear he understands me.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Wed8": "$7I've been thinking about opening my own shop again, here in Pelican Town.#$b#$0Do you think it's a good idea?#$e#$2I'm just scared I'll fail...again.#$e#$1Sorry for being a bummer. I'll stop.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Wed10": "$4I still get nervous around you. Do you think that feeling is ever going to go away?#$e#$18I hope not.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Thu": "$16I'm growing poppies.#$e#$1No, not for tea. I'm gonna bake some muffins for Leah.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Thu2": "Solarion Chronicles is pretty fun.#$b#$8Abigil gets...really into her character.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Thu4": "I want to redesign my Solarion Chronicles character.#$b#$7Seb said mine is fine, but I don't know...I'm not feeling it anymore.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Thu6": "I miss my hot mugs of tea, but it's just sweltering these days.#$b#$1Good thing I love iced tea just as much!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Thu8": "$1One thing I miss from the city is the fast food.#$e#$0Sometimes, you just want a big plate of grease. Like now.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Thu10": "$16Come over tonight?#$b#$6Or not, if you don't want to.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Fri": "$14The bees can't get you...not if you walk fast enough!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Fri2": "It's days like this that make me want to chop off my hair.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Fri4": "$9You don't shop at Joja, do you?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Fri6": "It's a good thing Pelican Town is walkable. I've never had my own car",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Fri8": "I suck at pool. Like I really suck.#$b#$1I can't even beat Sam!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Fri10": "%Tilly pecks you on the cheek.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Sat": "$7Ughh, it's so hot.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Sat2": "$3I never walk past Jojamart. For good reason.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Sat4": "I'm trying to do exposure therapy.#$b#$7I sit outside and read...vulnerable to bees.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Sat6": "$1If you ever want to play Solarion Chronicles again, let me know! Or Seb. Or Sam!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Sat8": "$1As much as I hate getting sand everywhere, I just love sunbathing at the beach.#$b#$0Hm? Oh, well, honestly, I'd rather go alone. It's my me time!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Sat10": "$1Come visit me at work next week. Gunther won't mind!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Sun": "$9Did I put sunscreen on today?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Sun2": "There should be some community fruit trees around town.#$b#$11Where's Mayor Lewis? I need to tell him my idea.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Sun4": "$8I should join Leah at the tidal pools sometime...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Sun6": "$8Fresh peach juice...need it...guh...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Sun8": "%Tilly is talking with someone on the phone. She's speaking a different language, but you hear 'Mama'.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_Sun10": "$1Sun's out, buns out! You know, metaphorically.#$b#$11Or literally, if you want.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_12": "$1Today will be the perfect day.#$b#$8I say that every year.",
	
	//Fall
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Mon": "%Tilly is grumbling under her breath. You hear something about 'Jojacorp'",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Mon2": "I love crunching leaves under my shoes.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Mon4": "This season has the best festivals!#$b#$1One day, I'll have my own display at the Fair.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Mon6": "I need new clothes. I think it's time to ask Haley where she shops.#$b#$8I don't want to, but I will.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Mon8": "$1You look nice today, @!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Mon10": "Date night this week?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Tue": "I turned the kettle off right?$8",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Tue2": "I can't wait for the bees to go away.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Tue4": "If you happen to have Fairy Rose Honey, I'll pay good money for it.#$b#$1Well, I'll pay a fair price.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Tue6": "I tried talking to Shane at the Saloon the other day, and he glared at me.#$e#$3It's not like I'm the friendliest, but I was trying to be nice.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Tue8": "Gus has been making me a specialty pizza every week with surprise ingredients.#$b#1Broccoli pizza is pretty good!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Tue10": "$9Abigail has been bugging me about our relationship and how we started dating.#$b#$8Sebastian has not.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Wed": "A bit chilly, but not bad.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Wed2": "Jas is up to 50 skips in a row.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Wed4": "I still have boxes of books I haven't unpacked yet.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Wed6": "$1A hay ride would be fun, don't you think?#$e#$8I wonder if Shane would be willing to do one with Jas and Vincent. And me!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Wed8": "My parents eat a lot of Sunflower Seeds.#$b#$1I started eating them too recently.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Wed10": "$16I wish I could have met your Grandpa, @.#$b#$17I like hearing Evelyn's stories about him.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Thu": "$21GAH! Don't sneak up on me like that!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 16",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Thu2": "I need to pick up some pickles for my sandwiches.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Thu4": "$8Mm, I'm really craving hashbrowns.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Thu6": "$9I need to add seeds to my shopping list for Tomato.#$b#$1He goes through them so fast.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Thu8": "Sometimes I miss my brother, and his cooking especially.#$b#$8We're not as close anymore. He's the golden child.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Thu10": "$8Huh? Oh, um. Nothing.#$e#$2Just feeling a bit down.#$b#$4A hug might help.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Fri": "%Tilly catches your eye but immediately looks away awkwardly.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Fri2": "Hey, @. How's the farm?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Fri4": "Last time I was at Sebastian's house, Demetrius gave me some Rice Pudding.#$b#9I think I like it?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Fri6": "If you catch a Salmon, can you freeze it and sell it to me?#$b#$1It's my favourite fish.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Fri8": "$1The only cocktail I can have without getting too wasted is Shrimp Cocktail.#$e#$16Oh c'mon, laugh!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Fri10": "$1Fall is kind of romantic don't you think?#$b#$4Maybe I'm just projecting.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Sat": "%Tilly smiles at you, but it doesn't quite reach her eyes.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Sat2": "%Tilly gives you a smile and wave. A true smile!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Sat4": "$16What kind of treats does %pet like? I'll drop some off!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Sat6": "Whenever I call my mom, she tells me to get contacts from Harvey.#$b#1I think glasses are part of my charm, wouldn't you agree?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Sat8": "If I could eat Bread for every meal, I would.#$e#$8Honestly I kind of have been. I've been feeling lazy.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Sat10": "$1Hey @. I baked a batch of muffins for Leah, but I saved a special one just for you. [(O)651]",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Sun": "$8Hey.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Sun2": "Howdy! Or something more natural.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Sun4": "I can't turn down a slice of Marnie's Pumpkin Pie.#$b#$16And I don't even like Pumpkin that much.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Sun6": "$8Shane smells like beer a lot.#$e#$9I think it might be influencing me to dislike him more.#$b#$0Because beer is gross.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Sun8": "Part of the reason I wear gloves is so stop myself from picking at my nails.#$e#$9It's a bad habit I still haven't been able to fully break.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_Sun10": "I just wanted to tell you that you make me feel valued.#$b#$3Ugh, that was so cheesy.#$b#$6...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_14": "$8What should I be for Spirit's Eve?#$b#$1Hmmm...I want to be cute and spooky at the same time!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_26": "$1Finally, my favourite festival!#$b#$16I get a chance to dress up and everything is spooky in a way I can handle!",

	//Winter
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Mon": "%Tilly is gleefully crunching snow beneath her boots.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Mon2": "%Tilly is sniffling a bit and coughing. Better go see Harvey soon.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Mon4": "$1Despite my dark dress, I really love the holidays.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Mon6": "$9Yes, I sometimes drink my tea with Maple Syrup.#$b#$0Who told you? It's not that big of a deal!#$e#$3Everyone thinks I'm crazy.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Mon8": "Karaoke this Friday at the Saloon. Are you in?#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Mon10": "%Tilly hugs you tightly, teeth chattering.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Tue": "$9Winter is the best season. Because there's no bees.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Tue2": "$15It's already %time?#$b#$3Ugh! The cold makes me so sluggish.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Tue4": "$9Abigail is pretty obvious about Seb. Have you noticed?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Tue6": "Let me tell you a secret...#$b#$21My hair isn't naturally white. Gasp!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Tue8": "Sometimes I miss how busy Zuzu City is.#$b#$16Pelican Town can be a little too peaceful.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Tue10": "Dating you comes with some great perks.#$b#$1For example, you're my own personal space heater!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Wed": "$8Hi, bye.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Wed2": "$8*sigh*...I miss my heels.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Wed4.1": "I stocked up on petals. Hopefully they last me through the season.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Wed4.2": "$9My honey is crystallizing a lot faster in the cold. Ughhh.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Wed6": "The nice thing about Winter is that I never need melatonin.#$b#I'm always sleepy.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Wed8": "I really hate hats.#$b#$16Even though it's freezing, I will not wear a hat!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Wed10": "$16Aww, your cheeks are all red from the cold.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Thu": "$8Cold, cold, cold, cold!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Thu2": "Is mead hard to brew by yourself?#$e#$1Oh great! I guess I'll have to go get a keg. I'm sure Robin can help me.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Thu4": "I don't have central heating. Just my fireplace.#$e#I pay Alex to chop wood for me.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Thu6.1": "$1I asked Sebastian if he'd like my frozen tears just as much, and he gave me that classic Seb look. Typical.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Thu6.2": "My pearl necklace was handed down from my mom.#$b#$8I pretty much only wear pearls because of her.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Thu8": "$14Does my hair look okay? Are you sure?#$b#$9My braids feel uneven.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Thu10": "$16We should go ice skating!#$b#$1Catch me if I fall? Which is highly probable?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Fri": "%Tilly nods at you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Fri2": "$16Pierre needs a delivery service so I can go out less.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Fri4": "I made a whole pot of congee yesterday.#$e$#$1I'm gonna eat it for every meal for the next 3 days.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Fri6": "I keep telling Sam he should do shows at the Saloon.#$b#$3No one listens to my good ideas.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Fri8": "Sometimes I practice smiling in the mirror. I feel like I do it wrong.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Fri10": "$4You almost make me happy that Jojacorp ran me out of business.#$b#$15Oh Yoba, do we owe our relationship to that evil company?!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Sat": "%You say hi to Tilly, but she can't hear you under her earmuffs.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Sat2": "$9People need to stop gifting me Beer.#$e#$0Sometimes I give it to Alex, but it just goes to waste otherwise.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Sat4": "I hope it doesn't snow again. I'm gonna get blocked into my house.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Sat6": "I find out a lot of interesting....tidbits when I chat with Marnie.#$b#$11No, definitely NOT about Mayor Lewis.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Sat8": "$3Alex hit me with a snowball the other day.#$e#$11I'm plotting my revenge.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Sat10": "$16The holiday season makes me so emotional.#$b#$8...#$b#$4No one makes me feel seen like you do.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Sun": "%Tilly almost slips, but recovers.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Sun2": "$7H=hey, @! C-can't, c-chat!!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Sun4": "$3I usually try not to walk past Jojamart, but I can't stand to be out in the cold longer than I need to be!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Sun6": "A nice soak at the Bathhouse is just what I need in the Winter.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Sun8": "$1I never built snowpeople as a kid. I think I might try to this Winter.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_Sun10": "$11I think you have a crush on me.#$b#$1Yeah, yeah, we're dating. Play along!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_1": "I already turned my fireplace on.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_5": "Squidfest is soon!#$b#$1I'm going to get such a good deal on squid for Calamari.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_14": "That submarine ride is pretty spooky. It gets so dark in the water!#$e#Yeah, I'll still go again this year.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_24": "$1Happy Eve of the Feast of the Winter Star!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32#$e#$0I just love the spirit of the holiday. I can't wait to give my secret friend their gift!",
	
	//Birthdays
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.spring_10": "I'm going to deliver a bottle of Cranberry Candy to Vincent today.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.spring_27": "$1It's Emily's birthday!#$b#She deserves all the gemstones in the world.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 20",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_4": "I have some Fairy Rose honey for Jas. I'm trying to encourage her to try new things.#$b#$1I'm also bringing her a doll, in case she hates it.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_17": "$11Penny has no idea what to give to Sam today for his birthday.#$e#Me? I'm baked him a Maple Bar.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_2": "$1I bound Penny's favourite book for her birthday. And I got Leah to design the cover.#$b#It's my best work so far!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_5": "I special-ordered an expensive pomegranate for Elliott. He better like it.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_18": "$11I heard Mayor Lewis stressing last week about a gift for today's special someone.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_24": "I helped Evelyn cook a leek feast for George. I hope he enjoys it!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_3": "I think I'll head up to the mountain and have a cup of tea with Linus today.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_20": "Evelyn doesn't want anything for her birthday.#$b#$1I insisted on at least baking and having a small tea party.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_23": "$1Leah and I are going to devour this charcuterie board I made, complete with a little jar of specialty honey I found at the farmer's market wayyy back in the summer.",
	
	//Items
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptBouquet": "$4I'm glad you picked up on my hints. I must have lent you 5 different romance novels.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)340": "$1Thank you! I never have enough honey for my tea.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)341": "$1Another beautiful tea set for my collection!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)100": "$16What a beautiful artifact! I wonder what kind of wine was in here...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)348": "$16I'll have a glass of this tonight, thanks!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)797": "$lOh my...this is lovely. Pearls are my gemstone of choice, as you can tell.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)106": "$1I think I'll use this at the beach.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)445": "$1Ooh, this is going to make for an expensive snack later.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)424": "$1Yum! I love brie.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)426": "$16I think I'll give this to Leah, it's her favourite.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)428": "$9I'll dye this to use later. Maybe I'll embroider it? Hm...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)459": "$16Mead is my favourite! Thanks.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)614": "$1I drank a cup this morning, but I won't say no to another!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)447": "$16I like eating this with a Maki Roll.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)228": "$1Ooh, sushi! My fave.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)724": "$11People think I'm weird for putting this in my tea.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)84": "Did you make this yourself?#$b#$11Kidding.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)595": "$1Thanks, I'll brew some tea with this!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)597": "$1Thanks, I'll brew some tea with this!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)202": "$1Mm, I love squid.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)213": "$1Wow, it's extra crispy!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)216": "Is there anything better than a crusty baguette?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)203": "Yum! Did you get the recipe from Evelyn?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)251": "$1Guess I'll plant another!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)730": "$1Mm, it smells a bit spicy. Yum.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)731": "I'll eat anything with Maple Syrup.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)903": "If I'm not drinking tea, I'm drinking this. Or water.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift(O)907": "I could eat this every day.",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift_Wem.Bundle.Tilly_TeaEgg": "$1You used my recipe! Yummy!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift_Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HoneyCake": "$1Made with %farm honey? Yum!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift_Wem.Bundle.Tilly_TeaCake": "$16Ooh, I'm going to have this with a cup of tea for dessert.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.AcceptGift_Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SweetTea": "$1Mm, I'm never not craving this.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.RejectItem_Wem.Bundle.Tilly_ElliottBook": "$1Reading Elliott's book again? Be careful with it!",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.RejectItem(O)167": "$5You're lucky I don't have a book right now.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.RejectItem(O)460": "$4You're thinking about marriage already? I'm not sure we're ready yet.#$b#$1Don't worry, I still love you.",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Elliott.RejectItem_Wem.Bundle.Tilly_ElliottBook": "$1Ah, it does bring me joy to see you enjoying my book.",

	//CTs
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.GreenRain_Finished": "$1Huh, looks like the rain actually helped my fruits!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.cc_Complete": "$7Thank Yoba that hunk of junk building is fixed up now. It was creeping me out!#$e#$1I can't wait to use the kitchen!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.dating_Penny": "$11Thank Yoba you asked Penny out.#$b#She talks my ear off about you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.dating_Emily": "Get ready for Emily to use you as a mannequin.$1",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.dating_Sam": "$8If Penny seems down, well...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.gotPet": "I heard you got a new pet, @!#$b#$1Could I come visit to see %pet?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.LeoDeparture": "A new kid?#$b#$21An orphan?#$b#$16Oh wow, I'm glad he agreed to come to Pelican Town.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.pamHouseUpgrade": "$10You're amazing, @. Thank you for donating the new house to Penny and Pam.#$b#$1I'm so grateful to you. Penny deserves it.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.pamHouseUpgradeAnonymous": "$1I'm so grateful to the anonymous donor. Penny deserves it, for sure.",

	//Resort
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Entering": "$1Ahh! A proper island getaway!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort": "$1I need a nice, cold bottle of Ginger Ale and then I'll be fully relaxed.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_2": "",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Bar": "I alternate between regular and virgin Piña Coladas, or else I'll throw up.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Bar_2": "$1How Gus keeps these drinks ice cold, I don't know but I'm happy about.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Chair": "$1Ahhh....",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Chair_2": "Alex and I fight over this chair sometimes.#$b#$11I always win.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Shore": "I saw a crab. I hope I don't get pinched by one.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Shore_2": "Willy forbade us from actually swimming. Laaaame.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Towel": "$1Normally I bring two towels, but I forgot.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Towel_2": "$8I just know I'm gonna be sandy all week.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Umbrella": "$1I brought a parasol, but it's not as big as this umbrella!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Umbrella_2": "I can never put on enough sunscreen.#$b#$9My shoulders always get a bit sunburnt.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Wander": "$9I hope the island is safe.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Wander_2": "I kind of want to explore the island, but that volcano is pretty intimidating.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Resort_Leaving": "You know, the boat ride is actually pretty smooth. I can't wait to come back!",

	//Other Villagers
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Emily.Tilly_Matilda": "You've met Tilly right?#$b#$1Her full name is Matilda. Don't ever call her that though, for your own good.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Emily.Tilly.JojaCT": "$2Tilly's been in an awful mood since the warehouse was completed.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Haley.Tilly_Matilda": "I like Tilly's outfits, but she should really wear more colors.#$e#She hates when I tell her that.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Penny.Tilly.JojaCT": "$2I'm happy that Mom is working again, but Tilly is taking this really hard...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Seb.Tilly.JojaCT": "$5...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Evelyn.Tilly.JojaCT": "$2Oh dear, Tilly is really quite upset about that warehouse.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Elliott.Tilly.JojaCT": "$1I am quite confident my new writings will put a smile on Tilly's face, do you not agree?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Elliott.Fri2": "I would like Tilly to hand-bind my novel when...if I finish it, but she does seem reluctant.",
	
	//Marriage
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.patio.Tilly": "$1My garden is nothing compared to the farm, but it sure is cute.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.spouseRoom.Tilly": "$1I'm glad all of my hobby things could fit in here.#$b#$11They keep me sane.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Indoor_Day_0": "$16Tomato is settling in well. He loves the extra space!#$e#$16I'm glad %pet is so accommodating too.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Indoor_Day_1": "I brewed some Green Tea. Have a cup baby. [(O)614]",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Indoor_Day_2": "What if we had a little library? I still have so many books back at my house.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Indoor_Day_3": "$1I'm gonna be binding books alllll day.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Indoor_Day_4": "$16My tea plants are doing well. I think they can sense that they're on a farm.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Indoor_Night_0": "$16I'm having another cup of tea before bed. Decaf!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Indoor_Night_1": "$1%pet is so cuddly in the evenings.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 20",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Indoor_Night_2": "$26It's been a looong day. I'm going to read in bed.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Indoor_Night_3": "How was your day, babe? Let me get a snack and we can chat.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Indoor_Night_4": "Don't clean up those papers on the floor of my hobby room.#$e#$1Yes, they're there for a reason!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Outdoor_0": "$16I think I've gotten used to the farm smell. I kinda like it now.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Outdoor_1": "Ahh, I could use a nice glass of Sweet Iced Tea.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Outdoor_2": "$1Just taking in the morning air before getting into the weeds!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Outdoor_3": "I can't believe how much fruit and how many flowers are at my disposal now.#$b#$1Your crops are the highest quality baby.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Outdoor_4": "$1Ohh, can we name a Sheep after me? Please hon?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Rainy_Day_0": "I'm definitely staying in with a book and a cup of tea.#$b#$1Wanna join, sweetheart?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Rainy_Day_1": "$11We should stay in bed all day today.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Rainy_Day_2": "$1Tomato gets really excited when it rains.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Rainy_Day_3": "$16I'm so sleepy. The rain is really good ASMR.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Rainy_Day_4": "$16Less plants to water today. I'm glad you have a bit of a break.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Rainy_Night_0": "$8Pitter patter, pitter patter...#$e#$21EEK!#$b#$26Babe, you scared me!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Rainy_Night_1": "$16Oh hon, you're soaked!#$b#$11Let's get you out of those clothes.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Rainy_Night_2": "$16I made dinner, mmwah! [(O)730 (O)196]",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Rainy_Night_3": "$9Which book should I read tonight?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Rainy_Night_4": "$1I missed you today. Kiss please!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.OneKid_0": "$1%kid1 has to be the cutest baby in the Valley. Maybe the entire world.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.OneKid_1": "I just love hearing %kid1 babble and talk. It's adorable.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.OneKid_2": "$16%kid1 chooses a bedtime story from my bookshelf every night.#$e#$1We're raising a scholar!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TwoKids_0": "$1%kid2 is just enamored with the cows. They even moo.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TwoKids_1": "$1Both %kid1 and %kid2 look like you. So unfair!#$e#$1$8I'm gonna dye their hair white.#$b#$1Kidding!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Good_1": "$26I love you. Did I tell you that today?#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 60",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Good_2": "$11Don't you look cute?#$b#$1Well, you look cute every day.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Good_3": "$26Thank you for always being so supportive and understanding.#$e#$4I just feel extra sentimental today, okay?!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Good_4": "I smooch my Mermaid's Pendant every night, right after I smooch you goodnight.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.funLeave.Tilly": "$1I'll see you later, okay baby? Don't miss me too much!#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.funReturn.Tilly": "$1I'm hoooome! I missed you. How was your day?#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.summer_12_marriage": "$16Today's a special day~#$b#$26Can I have a birthday kiss?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.fall_26_marriage": "$1Finally, my favourite festival!#$b#$1We should wear a couple's costume one year. Wouldn't that be cute?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_5_marriage": "Squidfest is soon!#$b#$1Will you fish some up for Calamari?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.winter_24_marriage": "$1Happy Eve of the Feast of the Winter Star, honey!#$e#$0I just love the spirit of the holiday. You get your gift first. [(O)74]",

	
	//JojaDialogue
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Introduction": "Oh, hello. You must be the new farmer Penny told me about.#$b#$3The one that allowed JojaCorp to take over this town.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.DumpsterDiveComment": "$3...seriously?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.HitBySlingshot": "$5OWW! What is WRONG with you?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.GreenRain": "%Tilly is ignoring you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.GreenRain_2": "%Tilly is ignoring you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Fair_Judged_PlayerWon": "%Tilly is ignoring you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.RejectItem_458": "$5I would never date you.#$b#$11And didn't I tell you never to talk to me again?",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Mon": "%Tilly is ignoring you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Mon2": "%Tilly scoffs and brushes past you.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Tue": "%Tilly is ignoring you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Tue2": "%Tilly is grumbling under her breath. About you, obviously.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Wed": "%Tilly is ignoring you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Wed2": "$3Don't talk to me.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Thu": "%Tilly is ignoring you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Thu2": "$3No thanks.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Fri": "%Tilly is ignoring you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Fri2": "$3As if.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Sat": "%Tilly is ignoring you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Sat2": "$8Um, gross.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Sun": "%Tilly is ignoring you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.JojaRoute.Sun2": "$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	
	//Tilly Schedule Strings
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.Tue.000": "I want to rearrange my books again. This happens a lot.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.Thu.000": "There’s a lot of history on these shelves. I wonder how long it will take for me to read through it all. #$e#$9History isn’t my favourite, but might as well since I’m working here.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.Fri.000": "$17Hmm...this one's nice.#$b#$17Oo...but so is this one.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.SumFri.000": "$1I know Dusty is fenced off, but I like to keep him company sometimes.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.Sat.000": "$Evelyn is so knowledgable about plants and gardening.#$b#$16She gives amazing advice.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.Bday.000": "$1Alex didn't charge me for my scoop today!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.Bookcase.000": "$9I should read a new book right? I have so many unread ones, it's overwhelming!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.Gardening.000": "$1To be honest, I don't like gardening that much, but it's satisfying to see hard work come to fruition. Pun intended.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.Gardening.001": "I buy most of my produce from Pierre, but I select a few crops every season to cultivate to make tea with.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.Gardening.002": "$1My plants are thriving!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.Binding.000": "$17Why is it so hard to make the edges crisp? I bought a bone folder and everything!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.Binding.001": "$11I'm determined to add headbands to all my rebound books.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.Binding.002": "$9Glue...glue everywhere.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.Binding.003": "Cutting book cloth is kind of satisfying, with the right scissors!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.DesertFestival": "These snacks are delicious. I only wish there were more iced drinks.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.DesertFestival_2": "$1Penny wouldn't take my bet on who's going to win.#$b#$11Maru did. She did a bunch of calculations, and I think I'm going to be out 5 gold.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.DesertFestival_marriage": "$9Babe, hold me back from jumping in the pond. It's sweltering!!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.NightMarket": "$8The coffee smells really good...but I don't want to be up all night.#$b#$1Even though it's the Night Market!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.TillySchedStrings.NightMarket.Marriage": "$16Hey sweetie, think I could join you on the submarine?#$b#$1The Captain won't mind if we kiss a little, right?",
	
	"Cooking.000": "$16I'm just having leftovers tonight.",


	//NPC Schedule Strings
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PenTillyShop.000": "$1Jas and Vincent really look forward to our Tilly days.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_VinTillyShop.000": "I want another cookie, but Miss Penny said not until I'm done my work.#$b#$1I like the star-shaped one!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JasTillyShop.000": "I like Miss Tilly's cookies. I try really hard not to get crumbs on Miss Penny's books.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_EvTillyShop.000": "$1Some tea and a good book is a lovely start to the week.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_LeahTillyShop.000": "Tilly's plants are great for studies.#$b#1Nice of her to let me be in here.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_CarTillyShop.000": "I try to rotate my tea of choice whenever I come here.#$b#$1They're all good! You can't go wrong.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SamTillyShop.000": "Solarion takes forever. I love it.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SebTillyShop.000": "%Sebastian is laser-focused on the game.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_MaruTillyShop.000": "I'm just grabbing a drink and a snack before all my tinkering.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HarvTillyShop.000": "I love coffee, but an occasional tea is nice too.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JodiTillyShop.000": "Tea is soothing.#$b#$1I convince Kent to come by promising to buy a box of pastries for the family, too.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_KentTillyShop.000": "Hmm, the Maple Bar looks good.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SophiaTillyShop.000": "$1Tilly has a pretty great selection of mangas.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_GuntherTillyShop.000": "Tilly has a few books I'm eyeing for my personal library.",


	
	//Festival
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_spring13": "$8This is a good reminder to make some tea eggs.#$e#$1Hm? Oh! Tea eggs are a yummy dish from my culture.#$e#$16I like making them by hard-boiling the eggs, cracking the shells, and marinating them in a sauce made of tea and spices!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_spring13y2": "I dyed some of the eggs with Emily.#$b#$1Thankfully she had smocks. Paint got everywhere.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 56",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_spring13spouse": "$16I painted an egg to look like you. It's adorable.#$b#$1I'm gonna take it home.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_spring24": "$3I learned the dance, but I'm not wearing that dress.#$b#$11Emily made me a black version.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 20",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_spring24y2": "$3Haley told me last year that I needed dance lessons.#$b#$9Yoba...#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_spring24spouse": "$6I'm kinda looking forward to dancing this year.#$b#$1I wonder why.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_summer11": "I poured a thermos of my tea into the soup.#$e#$7I think it's beyond saving, though.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_summer11y2": "$0Mm...roast pig.#$b#$1I gave Linus some of my honey to brush over it. Yum.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_summer11spouse": "$16What did you add to the soup babe?#$b#$11Remember, we have to eat the soup too!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_summer28": "$16I wish these jellies came around more often. They're beautiful.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_summer28y2": "%Tilly is making bobbing motions with her hands, laughing with Emily.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_summer28spouse": "$26You're going to look so beautiful in the glow of the jellies.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_fall16": "$11I'm gonna get my tarot read by Welwick.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_fall16y2": "$1Leah's sculptures are so beautiful, aren't they?#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_fall16spouse": "$8Should I apply for a display next year?#$b#$1Or we could share yours!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_fall27": "$34I'm a bee, if you couldn't tell.#$b#$35Super scary but cute at the same time.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_fall27y2": "$37This kinda smells like green apple jelly.#$e#$34Oh hey. Nice costume!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_fall27spouse": "$36Do you need me to hold your hand through the maze?#$e#$35Kidding...but I need to hold yours!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_winter8": "$3Not. Excited. About. The smell.#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 12",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_winter8y2": "Our snowman looks pretty good, huh?#$action Spiderbuttons.BETAS_EmoteNPC Wem.Bundle.Tilly 32",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_winter8spouse": "$1Bring back some big, slimy fish for dinner hon! You got this!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_winter25": "$1I'm already on my third plate.#$b#$11I'm going to have five.#$b#$1And also dessert.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_winter25y2": "It warms my heart to see so many gifts under the tree.#$b#$1Vincent keeps asking me to guess which ones he wrapped.#$e#$11It's pretty obvious, but I play along anyway.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_winter25spouse": "$1Did you like your gift baby?#$e#$6All I want is a hug and kiss.",
	
	
