	"Wem.Tilly_Shop1": "~MENU~^^Green Tea^Jasmine Tea^Iced Matcha Latte^Chai^Iced Sweet Tea^Seasonal Drinks^^Honey Sponge Cake^Tea Cake^Cookies^Maple Bar^Cappuccino Mousse Cake^Star Cookie^Poppyseed Muffin^Seasonal Pastries",
	"Wem.Tilly_Shop2": "The display is chock full of delicious pastries. Your mouth is watering.",
