	//Quests
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_LostScissorsQuest.title": "Tilly's Special Scissors",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_LostScissorsQuest.text": "Tilly lost her fabric scissors. She remembers having them at Pierre's.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_LostScissorsQuest.objective": "Deliver Tilly's scissors to her.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_LostScissorsQuest.reaction": "$1Oh thank you! I must have dropped them when I was chatting with Caroline.",
	
	//Special Orders
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.SO_MapleOrder_Name": "Serious Syrup Sorrows",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.SO_MapleOrder_Text": "I've exhausted my maple syrup supply for the year, and it's only fall. Please, if anybody could deliver me half a dozen bottles, that would just about last me until spring! Advanced thanks from Tilly.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_MapleObjective_Text": "Deliver 6 bottles of Maple Syrup to Tilly's house.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.SO_FlowerDelivery_Name": "Tilly's Friendship Flower Feat",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.SO_FlowerDelivery_Text": "It's a shame that flowers won't grow outside in the winter. Let's bring some floral beauty to everyone while we wait for spring.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_FlowerDeliveryObjective_Text": "Gift flowers to 15 people.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.SO_HoneyOrder_Name": "Honey, I need Honey",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.SO_HoneyOrder_Text": "I'd really like to try some seasonal flower honey. I don't grow all types of flowers, so this would be a huge help to my flavour experiments. Advanced thanks from Tilly.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HoneyObjective_Text1": "Deliver 3 jars of Blue Jazz Honey to Tilly's house",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HoneyObjective_Text2": "Deliver 3 jars of Summer Spangle Honey to Tilly's house",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HoneyObjective_Text3": "Deliver 3 jars of Poppy Honey to Tilly's house",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HoneyObjective_Text4": "Deliver 3 jars of Sunflower Honey to Tilly's house",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.SO_ConstructionOrder_Name": "Tilly's New Venture",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.SO_ConstructionOrder_Text": "Help Tilly pursue her dreams of running another business by gathering the construction materials. She'll love you (more than she already does)!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_ConstructionOrderObjective_Text1": "Deliver 450 Wood to Robin's house.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_ConstructionOrderObjective_Text2": "Deliver 200 Stone to Robin's house.",
	
	"Tilly.SO_HongbaoDelivery_Name": "Gong Xi Fa Cai!",
	"Tilly.SO_HongbaoDelivery_Text": "In the spirit of Lunar New Year, fill the Red Envelopes with some gold and deliver them to Jas and Vincent.",
	"Tilly_HongbaoDeliveryObjective_Text1": "Give a Red Envelope to Jas.",
	"Tilly_HongbaoDeliveryObjective_Text2": "Give a Red Envelope to Vincent.",

	
	//Mail
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_TillyScissorsQuest.title": "Requesting Your Help",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_TillyScissorsQuest.text": "Dear @,^^I need a favour. I misplaced my fabric scissors! I don't do any bookbinding without them. I'm a little busy today, so could you please find them for me? I know I had them when I went to Pierre's, but that's it! ^^Thanks,^Tilly",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_EggMail.title": "Tea Egg Recipe",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_EggMail.text": "Dear @,^^I thought you might like my recipe for tea eggs after you asked about them yesterday. I suggest green tea for your first attempt. It's lighter in flavour and aroma so it's a great starting point.^^I usually use oolong and marinate the eggs for 24 hours.^^Let me know if you try making them.^^- Tilly",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_MapleOrderComplete.title": "Scrumptious Syrup Serenity",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_MapleOrderComplete.text": "Dear @,^^Thank you so much for all the maple syrup! I lost track of time this year and forgot to put up some of my tappers. Pierre keeps trying to sell me his stock, but straight-from-the-tree tastes so much better, I think. Anyway, I packaged up a tea set to show my appreciation. I highly encourage you to try putting maple syrup in your tea! Play around with what tea works best.^^Thanks again,^^Tilly",	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_FlowerDeliveryComplete.title": "Friendly Flower Feelings",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_FlowerDeliveryComplete.text": "Dear @,^^Thank you for all those flower deliveries. Some people definitely have more of a 'spring' in their step.^^Sorry. Anyway, I found some of this lying around. I'm sure you could make use of it.^^-Tilly",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HoneyOrderComplete.title": "Honey, Honey",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HoneyOrderComplete.text": "Dear @,^^Thanks so much for the honey! I have so many uses for it. Regular tea, mead, iced sweet tea, even whipped honey!^^I brewed a batch of sweet tea just for you. I hope you enjoy it!^^-Tilly",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HoneyCake.text": "Dear @,^^The honey I harvested doesn't taste too bad! I used a portion to bake a Honeycomb Sponge Cake. Have you ever had one? Here's the recipe. It's delicious!^^-Tilly",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HoneyCake.title": "The Bee's Knees",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_TeaCake.text": "Dear @,^^I host tea parties from time to time. I might invite you to one someday! If you receive an invitation, please bake a Tea Cake and bring it to the party! I usually bake it myself, but everyone contributes a little something. I've included a recipe on the back of this letter.^^-Tilly",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_TeaCake.title": "Nearly Tea Time",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_TeaParty.text": "Dear @,^^I'm hosting my tea party, Tilly Tea Time, very soon. Please stop by between 11 am and 4 pm to join us in our festivities. Tea will be provided, but please bring a Tea Cake! Evelyn, Penny, Leah, Emily, and Caroline will be joining us.^^Best,^Tilly",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_TeaParty.title": "An Invitation to Tilly Tea Time",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete.text": "My dearest @,^^I knew you were rushing around more than usual! Thank you for donating the construction materials for my shop, and thank you for your endless support. I'm so excited! Robin said she'll have the shop built quite soon.^^I'll put a little invitation to my grand opening in our mailbox the day before. Just for the fun of it, hehe.^^I love you! I'm going to kiss you 1 million times.^^Love,^Tilly",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete.title": "Special Order and My Special Someone",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_GrandOpeningMail.title": "Tilly's Grand Opening",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_GrandOpeningMail.text": "Dear @,^^Tomorrow's the day! You're invited to the grand opening of my new store, Tilly's Tea Shop!^^Something tells me you'll get a special shoutout. Swing by when I open (9:00 AM sharp).^^Love,^Tilly",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_AuctionBook.title": "A Piece of Pelican Town History",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_AuctionBook.text": "Dear @,^^I've just finished binding the auctioned-off copy of Elliott's novel. Mayor Lewis asked me to give it to you to donate to the Museum.^^I don't know why he didn't just ask me to do it since I live much closer. Well, buyer's choice I suppose. Pick a good spot in the display!^^-Tilly",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Portrait1.title": "Photographic Memory",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Portrait1.text": "Dear @,^^Haley was helping me photograph some new product photos for my storefront and she snapped a candid of me. She caught me drinking tea, surprising no one.^^She mentioned you might like a copy and to spread the word if anyone else would like their portrait taken.^^-Tilly",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Portrait2.title": "Tilly's Portrait",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Portrait2.text": "Dear @,^^Tilly stopped by the other day to have another portrait taken. A proper posed one this time. It turned out great!^^Be careful taking it out of the mailbox. If you two ever want a couple's portrait taken, please let me know!^^-Haley",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_TeaEggMailFallback.text": "Dear @,^^The festival yesterday reminded me to share my Tea Egg recipe with you. I suggest green tea for your first attempt. It's lighter in flavour and aroma so it's a great starting point.^^I usually use oolong and marinate the eggs for 24 hours. Let me know if you try making them.^^- Tilly",
	
	
	//Movies 
	"Wem.Bundle.MovieInvite_Invited.Tilly": "$1A movie? Oh sure! I've been meaning to go.",
	"Wem.Bundle.MovieInvite_Spouse.Tilly": "$1Movie date? Can we get seats in the back?",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_spring_movie_0_1.Text": "$1My brother took me to movies like this when I was little.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_spring_movie_0_2.Text": "$1This is just adorable!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_spring_movie_0_3.Text": "$1I didn't think I'd really like it, but it was actually pretty nostalgic.#$b#$7I should call my brother.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_summer_movie_0_1.Text": "$9I've never really been into westerns.#$b#$1I like the outfits though!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_summer_movie_0_2.Text": "$1Giddy up!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_summer_movie_0_3.Text": "Whew, that was kind of exhilirating!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_fall_movie_0_1.Text": "$7I'm not nervous...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_fall_movie_0_2.Text": "%Tilly is cowering behind her hands.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_fall_movie_0_3.Text": "$7Never again.#$b#$9Unrelated, does Pierre sell nightlights?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_winter_movie_0_1.Text": "$1You know what a miracle would be? A holiday discount at Pierre's.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_winter_movie_0_2.Text": "$1There's a happy ending, I know it.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_winter_movie_0_3.Text": "$1Didn't that movie make you want a cup of cocoa?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_spring_movie_1_1.Text": "I've watched a lot of nature video essays while book binding.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_spring_movie_1_2.Text": "$10Wow...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_spring_movie_1_3.Text": "$16I've always wanted to vacation on the Fern Islands.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_summer_movie_1_1.Text": "$7What's a Wumbus?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_summer_movie_1_2.Text": "%Tilly is making a face. Not a pleasant one.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_summer_movie_1_3.Text": "$8Umm...it was definitely something...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_fall_movie_1_1.Text": "I'm actually kind of excited for this!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_fall_movie_1_2.Text": "Don't scream...don't scream!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_fall_movie_1_3.Text": "$1This was kinda like Creep!#$b#$11Have you seen Creep? You need to watch that too.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_winter_movie_1_1.Text": "$1I read the plot online. Sounds heartbreaking. Perfect.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_winter_movie_1_2.Text": "$10I don't know what I would do...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_winter_movie_1_3.Text": "$6*sigh*...love is a fickle thing.",

	//Animation Strings
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_squat": "%Tilly is counting her reps.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Tea": "$1Ahh, a nice cuppa.#$b#$8Oh um, do you want me to make you a cup?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Beekeeping": "$38No beestings yet.#$b#$39Still worth it to harvest my own honey!",

	//OTHER Events 
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HaleyShopping.0": "Ooo...this top is so cute.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HaleyShopping.1": "Where's Emily?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HaleyShopping.2": "$1Oh, she's in her room.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HaleyShopping.3": "*peeks*",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HaleyShopping.4": "$7Don't you ever wear any colour other than black?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HaleyShopping.5": "$9Umm...no.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HaleyShopping.6": "$7You're missing out on a lot of cute clothes, especially on that website.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HaleyShopping.7": "*sighs*",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HaleyShopping.8": "$11Honestly, Haley, if you were really as fashionable as you say, you'd work with my limitations.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HaleyShopping.9": "$3Fine! Scroll down...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HaleyShopping.10": "That dress would be perfect for you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_HaleyShopping.11": "You're right! Add to cart.",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_AlexEgg.0": "It smells lovely.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_AlexEgg.1": "$1You can leave the eggs marinating for 24 hours, but they'll taste stronger if left longer.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_AlexEgg.2": "$9We went through two cartons of eggs...they only last about 3 to 4 days in the fridge, Evelyn.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_AlexEgg.3": "$1Don't worry dear, my Alex will polish them off rather quickly.#$b#$1He simply loves your recipe. Thank you for helping me make such a large batch.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_AlexEgg.4": "$1Right, Alex and his affinity for eggs.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_AlexEgg.5": "More tea eggs?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_AlexEgg.6": "Yes, dear.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_AlexEgg.7": "$1Oh score!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_AlexEgg.8": "Can I help crack the eggs?",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_CarolineSunroom.0": "Your plants are looking lovely!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_CarolineSunroom.1": "$1Thank you, Tilly. This is my happy place.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_CarolineSunroom.2": "$16I can tell why.#$b#$1If only I had the same passion. I love the end product, but not so much the process.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_CarolineSunroom.3": "$1This is certainly a labor of love.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_CarolineSunroom.4": "$16Vincent is convinced that your hair is green from drinking green tea.#$b#$1He asked me why mine isn't also green.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_CarolineSunroom.5": "$16I told him I dye my hair white, and now he also wants to dye his hair.#$b#$1I hope he's not bothering Jodi too much about it.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_CarolineSunroom.6": "Abigail wanted to dye her hair green when she was younger.#$b#$1If only she felt that way still.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_CarolineSunroom.7": "$16You want your child to dye their hair, my mom wants me to stop.#$b#$1Such is life.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_CarolineSunroom.8": "Anyway, would you like a cup of tea? I just harvested a new batch.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_CarolineSunroom.9": "$1I'd love one!#$b#$16By the way, what kind of fertilizer do you use?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_CarolineSunroom.10": "Deluxe Fertilizer! Let me sell you some at a discount.",
	
	"Tilly_HairDye.0": "The bleach is almost ready. Do you want a trim or anything?",
	"Tilly_HairDye.1": "$9Umm, no. I think it's okay for today.#$b#$8Maybe in about a month or so. My roots wait for no one, though.",
	"Tilly_HairDye.2": "$1Okay then, let's do this!",
	"Tilly_HairDye.3": "$1Okay, we just need to let the bleach sit and then we can tone.",
	"Tilly_HairDye.4": "$1Thanks, Em! You're the best.",
	"Tilly_HairDye.5": "Hey, I came up with a new cocktail named 'The Moonlight Jelly.'",
	"Tilly_HairDye.6": "Ooh, that sounds really cool. What's in it?",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_IslandPicnic.0": "It's a girl's day at Ginger Island!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_IslandPicnic.1": "So warm...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_IslandPicnic.2": "Thanks for bringing the drinks, Emily!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_IslandPicnic.3": "Of course! It's hot out here!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_IslandPicnic.4": "Remember your sunscreen!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_IslandPicnic.5": "$9Oh Yoba, I forgot again.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_IslandPicnic.6": "It sucks that Willy said we're not allowed to explore the island.#$b#$1I mean, look at that volcano!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_IslandPicnic.7": "$16If anyone's hungry, I packed a lot of food. Sandwiches, cake, and a thermos of Iced Sweet Tea!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_IslandPicnic.8": "$1Hey, @! Come to join the festivities?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_IslandPicnic.9": "$1C'mon, @! Let's dance~",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_IslandPicnic.10": "Emily...you're kicking up sand!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_IslandPicnic.11": "Any strawberries, Tilly?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_IslandPicnic.12": "Uh huh! In the basket!",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SophiaManga.0": "$16Hey, Sophia. I brought that new manga you were looking for!#$b#$1I got one copy for you, and one for me.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SophiaManga.1": "$1Oh my gosh, thank you Tilly!#$b#Should we read it together?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SophiaManga.2": "$16I'd love to. You can come over next week and I'll have tea and snacks.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SophiaManga.3": "$1Thanks Tilly. I can't wait.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SophiaManga.4": "I also finished My Super Villain School! Can you believe...",
	
	"Tilly_HongbaoGive.0": "$16Hey, @. Xin nian kuai le and gong xi fa cai!#$b#$1In other words, happy Lunar New Year and I wish you good fortune!",
	"Tilly_HongbaoGive.1": "I'm stopping by to drop off a couple Red Envelopes for you.",
	"Tilly_HongbaoGive.2": "These are filled with cash and typically given to family and children as gifts.#$b#$1There's no money in them for you, but I thought you might like to join the festivities and give them to Jas and Vincent.#$b#$16That's what I'll be doing later today!",
	"Tilly_HongbaoGive.3": "Anyway, I hope the year treats you well. I'll see you around.",
	
	//HEART Events 
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_1H.0": "Hmmm....",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_1H.1": "*flips page*",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_1H.2": "$17I need dark purple fabric to bind two books...and then a royal blue for another...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_1H.3": "$1Ah! These are perfect. I'll put in an order with Pierre right away!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_1H.4": "$9I hope I don't mess up this time. This is an expensive hobby...",
	
	"Tilly_2H.0": "Oh, hello @. Can I help you with anything?",
	"Tilly_2H.1": "$8Sure, I can help you find a book to read.",
	"Tilly_2H.2": "$q Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2HQ.1 null#What genre do you enjoy?#$r Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2HQ.1 50 Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_1#Romance.#$r Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2HQ.2 50 Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_2#Fantasy.#$r Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2HQ.3 50 Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_3#Science fiction.#$r Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2HQ.4 100 Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_4#Dystopian.#$r Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2HQ.5 50 Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_5#Horror.#$r Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2HQ.6 50 Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_6#Non-fiction.#$r Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2HQ.7 150 Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_7#Manga.#$r Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2HQ.8 50 Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_8#I don't know! Anything's fine.",
	"Tilly_2H.3": "$16I have a book in mind! Give me a minute.",
	"Tilly_2H.4": "I think it's here...",
	"Tilly_2H.5": "$16Here. I hope you enjoy this one.#$b#$8It's not too long. I know you must not have too much free time with all the farm work.",
	"Tilly_2H.6": "$16Feel free to stay and read until the rain lets up.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_1": "$11Romance? Someone on your mind?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_2": "$16You need something with dragons for sure.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_3": "$8Hmm, how about a space exploration novel?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_4": "$1Oh, I love those books too.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_5": "$8You're one of those, huh?#$b#$1No judgement! I'm just a scaredy-cat.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_6": "$16Gunther's curated a great selection of non-fiction, from history to horticulture.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_7": "$1You like manga too? We need to talk more about this sometime.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_2Heventquestion_8": "$8Well, I hope you like what I like, then.",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.1.0": "Yes, I know. You're hungry...like always!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.1.1": "$21Oh, @! You startled me.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.1.2": "$16I'm feeding my parrot, Tomato.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.1.3": "$1He's the sweetest. If he pecks you, it's probably your fault.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.1.4": "Do you want to feed him? Here, let's switch.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.1.5": "Have some seeds...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.1.6": "$1I think he likes you! He's a good judge of character.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.1.7": "He also likes fruit. Apricots especially!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.1.8": "I'll go get some for you.",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.0": "'Tilly? What are you doing? I've never seen you near JojaMart.'",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.1": "Yeah, I try to never walk past...here.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.2": "*sigh*",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.3": "I only moved to Pelican Town a year before you did.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.4": "$8I used to live in Zuzu City. Maybe you knew that already.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.5": "$17I used to run a bookshop there. It was cute, y'know? Small and cozy. It was just me and my part-time assistant.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.6": "$1The days weren't always easy, but it was fun. I got to choose the books we sold and I loved giving suggestions.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.7": "$8Until JojaCorp started selling books in their stores. I couldn't compete with their selection, or their prices.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.8": "$2So...I went bankrupt. Ugh, it's still so embarrassing to say.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.9": "$2Thanks, but I still feel a lot of shame...and bitterness.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.10": "$17I could have moved home, to my parents, but I didn't want to face them. They sounded so disappointed on the phone, not to mention my golden child of an older brother. He's a chemical engineer.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.11": "$2I just feel so lost, like a failure. What should I do now? I don't know.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.12": "$8My friend is a friend of Sandy. Have you met her? Anyway, she told me about this town.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.13": "*sniffle*",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.14": "I miss my shop...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.15": "$1Sorry to bring you down, @. You've caught me in a weird mood.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.16": "*sniffle*",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_4H.2.17": "$17Let's go somewhere else. The Saloon maybe?",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.0": "Oh...please don't sting me! I'm your friend!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.1": "'How goes the beekeeping?'",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2": "One sec...just...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.3": "$39You've just witnessed me pulling out my first honey frame ever!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.4": "$41Oh, I've been stung too many times to count.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.5": "$39I'm becoming less scared of bees though! I think...maybe?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.6": "$41Um...yeah, it's not really been smooth sailing.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.7": "$41The bees are feisty, I lost the queen when setting everything up, and I accidentally smoked myself!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.8": "Don't laaaugh!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.9": "$40Anyway...I'll tough it out. I feel proud of myself, despite the obstacles!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.10": "$39Once I've got a few batches of delicious honey, I'll invite you over for a tea party.",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.0": "$14No, mama. I'm not moving home!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.1": "...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.2": "$3I'm trying, okay? Why can't you support me?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.3": "$3I didn't...I didn't fail! I just, it wasn't my fault!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.4": "$14I don't want to go to law school, mama! No!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.5": "*sniffle*",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.6": "$20Caught me at another inopportune time, huh?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.7": "$2My mom called. I thought to just catch up, but it turned into her trying to get me to go home. Again.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.8": "$3She didn't say anything new. Just that she's disappointed in me, and so are dad and Landon.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.9": "$18My mom wants me to go to law school. Do something 'worthwhile' and become successful like my brother.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.10": "$2No, I don't. I want to do what makes me happy, but...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.11": "$q Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5HQ.1 null#$18Is my mom right? Should I just do the 'sensible' thing and go home? Give in?#$r Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5HQ.1 100 Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5Heventquestion_1#No, you should pursue something that you love, even if you're not sure what it is right now.#$r Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5HQ.2 -250 Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5Heventquestion_2#Yeah, she's right. You need direction and discipline.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.12": "*sniffle*",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.13": "$17Well, thanks for your thoughts. Sorry you had to witness all of this.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5H.2.14": "$16How about I make us some tea? That'll make me feel better.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5Heventquestion_1": "$16You're right. I've only got this life, and why would I want to waste it? Besides, I really like Pelican Town.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_5Heventquestion_2": "$2Oh, yeah. Maybe that makes sense. I guess I'll think about it more...",


	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.0": "$17Do you really want to watch and hang out while I attempt to rebind this book?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.1": "$1Well, I guess it is your perogative.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.2": "$17You're gonna see a different side of me today. A bad side of me. Worse than what I've already shown you!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.3": "'Bring it on! Your pessimism is no match for me.'",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.4": "$9I always forget a few steps, and everything turns out wonky.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.5": "$1I guess failing is part of the fun. The supplies aren't cheap though...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.6": "$7Would I ever sell a book bound by me?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.7": "$17I don't know. I mean, I suck at this.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.8": "$17I'm a little scared to open another business, no matter how small.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.9": "$1Thanks for the vote of confidence, @. I don't know if I'll ever get there, but I'll try my best.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.10": "$1There! Finished!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.11": "It's a little sloppy, but you can tell Tilly tried her best.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.12": "'Elliott reaaally wants you to bind his novel when he's finished writing.'",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.1.13": "Ughh, I mean, finish your book first at least! Then we'll see...",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.0": "You want me to what?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.1": "Tilly, I think that's enough for tonight.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.2": "Well, it's just a suggestion...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.3": "Nooo...let me finish this one! *giggle*!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.4": "You've only had two drinks, Tilly! I always forget how much of a lightweight you are.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.5": "I know, I know...*hic*! Oops..",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.6": "$20I've just been feeling down these days. I'm not usually like this.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.7": "Your parents again?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.8": "$20I miss my shop...I miss building something and making it a success. Something to feel proud about.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.9": "You know Tilly, you could start an online storefront. There's a market for custom-bound books. I've seen it on social media.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.10": "$1I've thought about it myself. We could even do it together.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.11": "I could help with the website.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.12": "It'll be a good first step toward reopening your shop. Hey, Haley could help too!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.13": "Help with what?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.14": "Marketing Tilly's new online store!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.15": "$14Oh, yeah, I could do that. My followers didn't come from nowhere, after all.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.16": "Thanks Haley...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.17": "As you know, Tilly, I have put in many a request for you to bind my novel once I am finished with it.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.18": "Consider my novel as your trial, and I will renumerate your services like any other customer.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.19": "$6That...is a good idea. Do you guys really think I should do this? I'm nervous just thinking about it.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.20": "Go for it!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.21": "Yep.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.22": "Definitely.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.23": "Undoubtedly.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.24": "I think it'll make you happy.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.25": "$4Maybe it's the alcohol talking, but I think you're right.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.26": "$6Thank you guys for putting up with this mess. You're the best.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.27": "$6Ahh, I'm getting too mushy!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_6H.2.28": "No more alcohol for a month!",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.0": "$1Thank you for coming everyone! We have two surprise guests today: Jas and Vincent.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.1": "Thanks for letting us come Miss Tilly!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.2": "Thank you...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.3": "$16As some of you know, I try to practice proper tea etiquette during these parties. For education and fun. Don't feel too much pressure!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.4": "$3What's 'etiquette'?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.5": "Etiquette is the expectations of behaving in certain situations.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.6": "$16And there are certain norms in my culture when it comes to tea.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.7": "$1Although, we had to sacrifice the seating plan a little bit to accomodate Jas and Vincent.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.8": "$1Now, let's begin with the types of tea we'll be drinking today.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.9": "The aromas are lovely...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.10": "First, we have Long Jing, a green tea...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.11": "This was lovely, dear. Thank you for having us.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.12": "$16I hope you guys enjoyed the Sponge Cake. And @'s delicious Tea Cake of course! Took a load off my hands this time.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.13": "So yummy!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.14": "It was delicious.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.1.15": "$1Let's do this again soon! Keep an eye out for my invitation.",
	
	//Book Signing
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.0": "I retrieved everyone from the refreshments to make the special announcement.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.1": "$1Yes, my publisher approved the auction.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.2": "$1Thank you Elliott! This is...nervewracking, but I appreciate this opportunity so much.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.3": "I must show my gratitude to Tilly, as she graciously accepted a commission to hand-bind a personal copy of my novel and designed a beautiful custom cover.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.4": "Lovely!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.5": "Very beautiful!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.6": "To celebrate a successful reading, I shall auction off an additional copy of my book to be hand-bound in similar fashion by Tilly.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.7": "Psst..Lewis...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.8": "Let's begin the bidding at 3000g!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.9": "3500g!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.10": "4000g!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.11": "6000g!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.12": "6500g!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.13": "7500g!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.14": "10,000g!!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.15": "Going once...twice...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.16": "$1Sold, to Lewis! What a lively display!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.17": "It will be a wonderful addition to this Museum. A piece of Pelican Town history.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.18": "$4I'd like to say a few words if that's okay.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.19": "$4Thank you for all of your support! It's been a tough road since Zuzu City...but I'm finally finding my footing again.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.20": "$1And thank you, Elliott, for commissioning me and letting me crash your book reading.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.21": "$4I'm excited to be able to leave a little piece of me in Pelican Town. Thank you again, everyone!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.22": "Woo!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_7H.2.23": "Congratulations Tilly!",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.0": "*sigh*",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.1": "$26Oh, @! I wasn't expecting you to drop by today.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.2": "'We haven't hung out in a while, are you avoiding me?'",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.3": "$7Oh...you noticed that, huh?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.4": "$17I've been...having reservations about our relationship.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.5": "$21Not that I don't want to be your girlfriend!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.6": "$17I just...I'm nervous that you won't like me as a girlfriend.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.7": "$20I don't really know how to act, you know? ",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.8": "$7I feel like I have to be perfect now. What if I don't measure up to your expectations?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.9": "'You don't have to do anything but be yourself. Even if you're scared!'",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.10": "'I'm not so easy to get rid of, okay? So you better stop trying!'",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.11": "$4Sorry, I know I'm overreacting.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.12": "$21Which reminds me, can you really handle all of my neuroses?!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.13": "$7I've been hiding them so well, but you're supposed to be transparent in a relationship...right?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.14": "'I'd rather you tell me you're scared than stay in your head. Promise.'",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.15": "$26That makes sense.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.16": "'How about this? We make a pact to communicate when feelings like this arise. Both of us!'",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.1.17": "'Let's seal the pact with a kiss!'",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.2.0": "$20I'm so nervous and my hands are sweaty. I need to to take my gloves off!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.2.1": "$0It's only a little online storefront...but still! What if no one buys anything?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.2.2": "$11Although in that case, I won't have to be anxious about terrible shop reviews.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.2.3": "$1Okay, okay! I'm going to publish the site soon. Thank you Sebastian! I just need to take a few deep breaths.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.2.4": "This is good for you. You'll see! You already seem lighter on your heels.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.2.5": "$1You're right...I can do this. My products have value. Elliott said so too!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.2.6": "*tiptaptiptiptap*",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.2.7": "And....there. We're live!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.2.8": "$1There's a lot of adrenaline flowing in my veins. I'm...strangely optimistic!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_8H.2.9": "$16Thank you guys for all your support. I couldn't have gotten here without you.",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PotteryDate.0": "$4Are you ready for our date?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PotteryDate.1": "$16Thanks for agreeing to pottery painting for our date.#$b#$1I usually go with Leah, but you're okay too, I guess!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PotteryDate.2": "$17Lettering is really difficult.#$b#$1The key is to use the little bottles and squeeze the tiniest bit while dragging the tip against the surface.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PotteryDate.3": "$17I can't believe you're finished painting already!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PotteryDate.4": "$1I'm not being a perfectionist!#$b#$17I just want to make sure this looks good...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PotteryDate.5": "$17I'm painting %favorite onto this mug!#$b#$4For you, of course.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PotteryDate.6": "$4Babe! Stop staring!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PotteryDate.7": "$1Oh, did you paint your mug for me?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PotteryDate.8": "$4That's really sweet, babe.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PotteryDate.9": "$17Y-you're so close, @.#$b#$4There are other people here!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PotteryDate.10": "Fine. Oneee kiss...on the cheek!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PotteryDate.11": "$4My hands had paint on them.#$b#$1And now your face does too.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_PotteryDate.12": "Now stop distracting me! Or we'll be here forever.",
	
	//Shop Ponder
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.0": "$9Hmm...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.1": "$1Oh, @. Hi, honey!#$b#$16Ah, I’m just daydreaming.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.2": "About me?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.3": "$11Not this time.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.4": "$7I was daydreaming about my shop. Or I guess, a new shop.#$b#$1I want a little cafe where people can buy tea and relax by reading or studying. Maybe purchase some of my bound books! Do you think it's a bad idea?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.5": "Of course not! What’s stopping you?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.6": "The usual. Failure...humiliation...but mostly I’m just nervous about committing to something new.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.7": "$1Although, I feel more hopeful than scared.#$b#$1I’m still trying to get used to that feeling, but I'm determined to do this!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.8": "$16Robin's been humouring me with some construction plans. She even offered to give me a discount on the renovation if I could source the materials.#$b#$1Maybe I could pay Alex to chop some wood and the like, since Elliott's auction was a huge success.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.9": "$1Of course I can show you the plans! C'mon, I'll need some help with the decor choices.",

	//Grand Opening Vanilla
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.0": "$1Thank you, everyone, for coming to the grand opening of Tilly's Tea Shop!#$b#$16Sorry it's so crowded. I didn't realize so many people would show up!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.1": "$16As everyone knows by now, I came, or fled rather, to Pelican Town after my bookshop was shut down in Zuzu City.#$b#$9I won't name by who.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.2": "$16This community has been a haven for me and has become my home.#$b#$17Not just a home away from home, but home.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.3": "$1Thank you everyone for your support! I didn't think I'd ever be afforded this opportunity again, but here I am.#$b#$4I'm not the best at expressing these feelings, so I think it might be best we move on.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.4": "$16Tilly's Tea Shop is a place where you can sit, relax, have a drink and a sweet treat.#$b#$16The shelves are lined with books you can read at your leisure or purchase to take home.#$b#$1Some books have been rebound by me, and are available for purchase as well!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.5": "$1For the grand opening, all drinks and snacks are on the house! Please feel free to stay as long as you'd like and enjoy yourselves!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.6": "Lovely!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.7": "It smells so good in here...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.8": "C'mon Jas!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.9": "One moment, Jodi!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.10": "Take your time!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.11": "$16It's been so hectic, I didn't have a chance to get a moment alone with you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.12": "$4I just wanted to tell you how much I appreciate you. You're just...I can't describe what this means to me.#$b#$1But I hope you don't mind that I'll be out of the house a lot more now.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.13": "$11I promise to bring home some pastries, if there are any left. Take some cake just in case!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.14": "$1See you at home, honey. I love you!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.15": "What can I get for you?",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.16": "$1Finally, I'd like to give special thanks to my partner, @.#$b#$4I'm not one to be so mushy publicly...but I could not have done this without @'s support. Not only emotionally and mentally, but @ was sweet enough to supply the construction materials to even build this shop.#$b#$4I lucked out. I love you!#$b#$1Ahem. Now, please enjoy the grand opening, everyone!",
	
	//Grand Opening SVE
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.0": "$1Thank you, everyone, for coming to the grand opening of Tilly's Tea Shop!#$b#$16Sorry it's so crowded. I didn't realize so many people would show up!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.1": "$16As everyone knows by now, I came, or fled rather, to Pelican Town after my bookshop was shut down in Zuzu City.#$b#$9I won't name by who.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.2": "$16This community has been a haven for me and has become my home.#$b#$17Not just a home away from home, but home.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.3": "$1Thank you everyone for your support! I didn't think I'd ever be afforded this opportunity again, but here I am.#$b#$4I'm not the best at expressing these feelings, so I think it might be best we move on.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.4": "$16Tilly's Tea Shop is a place where you can sit, relax, have a drink and a sweet treat.#$b#$16The shelves are lined with books you can read at your leisure or purchase to take home.#$b#$1Some books have been rebound by me, and are available for purchase as well!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.5": "$1For the grand opening, all drinks and snacks are on the house! Please feel free to stay as long as you'd like and enjoy yourselves!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.6": "It smells so good in here...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.7": "I hope there's manga...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.8": "C'mon Jas!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.9": "One moment, Jodi!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.10": "Take your time!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.11": "$16It's been so hectic, I didn't have a chance to get a moment alone with you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.12": "$4I just wanted to tell you how much I appreciate you. You're just...I can't describe what this means to me.#$b#$1But I hope you don't mind that I'll be out of the house a lot more now.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.13": "$11I promise to bring home some pastries, if there are any left. Take some cake just in case!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.14": "$1See you at home, honey. I love you!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.15": "What can I get for you?",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.16": "$1Finally, I'd like to give special thanks to my partner, @.#$b#$4I'm not one to be so mushy publicly...but I could not have done this without @'s support. Not only emotionally and mentally, but @ was sweet enough to supply the construction materials to even build this shop.#$b#$4I lucked out. I love you!#$b#$1Ahem. Now, please enjoy the grand opening, everyone!",

	
	//Stargazing
	"Tilly_Stargazing.0": "*hums*",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.1": "EEK! Who's there?",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.2": "$1Oh, @. It's only you.#$b#$6Thank Yoba! What if you were a bear instead?",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.3": "$16C'mon, join me. Lie down.",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.4": "I read a book about constellations last week. About the stars, the formations, the meanings.#$b#It's a clear night, so I thought I might try to see some.",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.5": "$4You can't see stars like these in the city.",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.6": "Stars...they make me feel so small.#$b#$4They make me think about fate.",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.7": "$q Tilly_Stargazing.Q.1 null#$8Do you believe in fate?#$r Tilly_Stargazing.Q.1 50 Tilly_Stargazing.eventquestion_1#Yes. Things happen for a reason.#$r Tilly_Stargazing.Q.2 50 Tilly_Stargazing.eventquestion_2#No, it's all about free will and choices.#$r Tilly_Stargazing.Q.3 50 Tilly_Stargazing.eventquestion_3#I'm not sure. Sometimes, maybe.",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.8": "I've always been conflicted.#$b#$17The concept of fate soothed me when I lost my store. But I also worked hard to open a store in the first place.",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.9": "$1It's a little too depressing for me to think about my entire life being predetermined.#$b#$1But maybe it was fate that led me to Pelican Town. And to you!",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.10": "$10Oh hey, look!#$b#$10Cassiopeia! I think...I'm not very good at identifying constellations yet.",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.11": "Twinkle twinkle little star, hehe!",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.eventquestion_1": "$11So you think we were destined to be friends?",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.eventquestion_2": "Wow, that's absolute. Your conviction is inspiring.",
	"Tilly_Stargazing.eventquestion_3": "Yeah, me too.",
	
	//Family Arc
	"Tilly_FamIntro.0": "'You look worried.'",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.1": "$9Ugh, you could say that.#$b#$17My mom sent me an email. She said she wants to have lunch and spend the day with me.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.2": "$3That's not what's gonna happen. I know her.#$b#$8She's going to come, have lunch with me, and spend the entire time trying to get me to go home.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.3": "$18Yeah, I told her we got married. She was...unhappy to say the least.#$b#$18I know she's still angry that I kept my family in the dark.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.4": "$3Oh you bet she'll want to meet you.#$b#$3She said lunch with me, but she means us.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.5": "$3Well, like usual, she didn't send me a date. She's just going to drop in.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.6": "$2I really don't want to see her.#$b#$2I mean, I do love her...but I'm happy right now.#$b#$2I don't want my peace to be disturbed.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.7": "$2I'm sorry if I'm...even snippier than usual in the coming weeks.#$b#$3I'm just really not looking forward to this.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.8": "$1I'm sure you can handle me!#$b#$11We wouldn't have made it to our wedding if you couldn't.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.9": "Anyway...I just hope this goes over fast, and easy.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.10": "Yoba, I can only dream...",

	"Tilly_FamVisit.0": "So this is where Matilda lives now...",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.1": "Dinky, huh?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.2": "Lots of farmland...",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.3": "Matilda!",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.4": "$21Mama?!#$b#$21Dad?! Landon?!",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.5": "Sweetheart.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.6": "$1Hi, honey! Surprise!",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.7": "$8I....Mama. I wish you would have told me you, all three of you, were coming today.#$b#$8...it's not a good time.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.8": "$1What could you possibly have going on in this town?#$b#$1Ben, Landon, come here and greet Matilda!#$b#We haven't seen you in so long.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.9": "Still look like a ghost.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.10": "Shut up!",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.11": "Don't, Landon. Not today.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.12": "$16Hi Dad.#$b#$3Hi...you.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.13": "Ever the bitter little sister.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.14": "$3Landon, stop teasing Matilda.#$b#$1How are you honey? When can we meet, what was it again...@?#$b#How are you earning money? This town doesn't seem to have all that much.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.15": "I...@ is busy. And I am too.#$b#$8You should visit the aquarium until...5 pm today.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.16": "Why don't we just go home?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.17": "Landon.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.18": "$3Matilda! We haven't seen you in over a year and you don't even seem excited that we're here!#$b#$3I want to spend the day with you. We'll pay for lunch, too, seeing as you probably don't earn much at wherever you're working right now.#$b#I just hope the food in this town is passable.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.19": "$9Mama, if you told me you were coming today, I'd have cleared my schedule.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.20": "$1Nonsense. You should always have time for your mother.#$b#$3Besides, you're always making excuses.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.21": "$3Okay, fine! I'll...show you around Pelican Town.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.22": "Pelican Town? Pfft.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.23": "$3Just follow me.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.24": "Hurry, Ben.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.25": "After a tour of Pelican Town, the family settles in at the Saloon for lunch.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.26": "This town is...nice, I suppose. Quaint.#$b#I'm not sure this is the right place for you though, Matilda.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.27": "$3Don't start, Mama. @ lives here. So I'm staying too.#$b#$3But even if I wasn't married, I'd still stay here.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.28": "What does @ do anyway? Actually, what do you do every day? Mooch?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.29": "$3Landon, stop that.#$b#But your mother is right, Matilda. We're still confused about what exactly you're doing with your life right now.#$b#We'll pay for law school, or business school. Even medical school, if you want that.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.30": "Exactly! It's only right.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.31": "$9I already said I don't want to pursue those things. I'm happy here.#$b#$3You have to find some way to be okay with that!",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.32": "$3Maybe if you weren't so secretive!",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.33": "$3You'd be disappointed either way!",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.34": "$2Honey, let's all calm down.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.35": "$3Dad, you're just as bad as her, you know!#$b#$5You still want me to be someone I'm not.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.36": "Your poor partner, funding your whole life.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.37": "$14Hey sweetie, Penny let you know where we were?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.38": "So you're the famous @ we've heard so much...err...heard about?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.39": "@, this is my mom, Rebecca.#$b#My dad, Benjamin.#$b#$3And Landon, who is unfortunately my brother.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.40": "Like it's a real treat for me.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.41": "$q Tilly_Fam.Q.1 null#$8So @, what do you do for a living? Matilda has not been forthcoming with any information.#$r Tilly_Fam.Q.1 50 Tilly_Fam.eventquestion_1#I'm an agriculturist, rancher, miner, fisher, and more.#$r Tilly_Fam.Q.2 100 Tilly_Fam.eventquestion_2#I'm a farmer. I own that plot of land to the right of the Bus Stop.#$r Tilly_Fam.Q.3 -100 Tilly_Fam.eventquestion_3#I'm an architect. (Lie).",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.42": "Well, it all sounds like a lot of labour! Hard work...",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.43": "$3Is that a problem, Mama?#$b#$3That @ isn't an engineer like Landon?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.44": "*snicker*",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.45": "$3You always think the worst of me, Matilda!#$b#I think...a farm is a fine choice.#$b#...As long as you are, ahem, successful?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.46": "$3Are you happy? Do you approve now?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.47": "$2Of @? Of course. That's not what we were worried about, Matilda.#$b#$2You need to make something of yourself. And farming might be what @ wants, but it's not what you want.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.48": "Was that a dig? Maybe a small one...",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.49": "$5What do you know? I have made something of myself!#$b#$5I'm not a lawyer, or a doctor, or a stupid mechanical engineer, but I'm holding my own!",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.50": "$8Let me pay Gus, and then I'll show you something.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.51": "Gus! Check please.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.52": "Hi Harvey, what can I get for you?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.53": "Matilda, why did you bring us here?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.54": "Maybe a Chai Latte today.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.55": "$2I brought you here because...this is my shop.#$b#$9Which you would have known if you bothered to read the sign outside instead of arguing with me.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.56": "You opened another store?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.57": "It's quite lively in here.#$b#$1I'm impressed, Matilda.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.58": "$21What?! Really?#$b#$2You're not disappointed in me?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.59": "Well...it's not what me or Daddy imagined for you. It never has been, you know that.#$b#$1But you seem happy, honey.#$b#$2As happy as you were running your shop in the city.#$b#$2I just wish you would have told us.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.60": "$2Would you have supported me? If I told you I wanted to open another shop?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.61": "$2No...probably not.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.62": "$2Listen Mama. I am happy here. @ has been supporting me for a while now, and I don't mean financially.#$b#$26@ gave me the confidence to open another shop, and I've never been happier.#$b#$2You just...you and dad never understood me.#$b#$2This is what I love doing, even if I'm not going to super wealthy on my own.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.63": "$4Honey...I'm so sorry. I just wanted the best for you.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.64": "$2We didn't want you to struggle like we did.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.65": "I know, dad. But struggling is part of life.#$b#$1I can handle myself, okay? You have to trust me.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.66": "$6I've missed you so much, honey. And we were so worried.#$b#$5Can you give me a hug? I haven't held you in far too long.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.67": "Way too sappy...",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.68": "$1Thank you for taking care of Matilda, @.#$b#$2We haven't been the best support system in recent years, so I'm happy she had you.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.69": "$1I think I should relieve Penny from running the shop now.#$b#$1I'll make you guys some drinks and some food. We can hang out here for the rest of the day.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.70": "$1We'll pay, honey. To support our little girl.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.71": "This better be good.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.72": "Shut up, Landon!",
	
	"Tilly_Fam.eventquestion_1": "$1You do do quite a lot. Sometimes I forget.",
	"Tilly_Fam.eventquestion_2": "$1It's quite beautiful. You maintain it so well, honey.",
	"Tilly_Fam.eventquestion_3": "$5@, why would you lie?#$b#$3@ is a farmer, Mama.",
	
	"Tilly_VisitOver": "$1I was dreading my family visiting before, but I'm really glad they did.#$b#$16I'm still in shock that it didn't end in disaster.#$b#$16I'll call home more. And visit too.#$e#$3Landon is still as annoying as smug as ever though. Some things never change.",

	//Book Recommendations
	"Tilly_SamBook.0": "$21Sam! You scared me!",
	"Tilly_SamBook.1": "Man, you scare easy.#$b#$10Anyway...I was hoping you could recommend a book for me.",
	"Tilly_SamBook.2": "$11Really?",
	"Tilly_SamBook.3": "Mom said I have to read more. To set a good example for Vincent.#$b#She said I should get a book that I can read to him, actually.#$b#Do you have anything that works?",
	"Tilly_SamBook.4": "$1Of course! Let me look at these shelves...",
	"Tilly_SamBook.5": "*flip...flip..*",
	"Tilly_SamBook.6": "$16Here, this one's the first in a coming-of-age series.#$b#$11It might be a little juvenile for you, though.#$b#$1Take this sci-fi novel too. Probably more your speed.",
	"Tilly_SamBook.7": "$1This is great! Thanks!",
	"Tilly_SamBook.8": "$16Sure! Sign the check-out book before you leave.",
	"Tilly_SamBook.9": "Later!",
	
	"Tilly_SandyBook.0": "Reading something good, sweetie?",
	"Tilly_SandyBook.1": "$1I somehow got distracted by a book on shoemaking. Cobbling.#$b#I was hoping it was about peach cobbler.#$b#$1Just kidding! So what brings you into town?",
	"Tilly_SandyBook.2": "I need something to keep me occupied during the slow days. Could you help me?",
	"Tilly_SandyBook.3": "$1Oh sure! What genres do you like?",
	"Tilly_SandyBook.4": "$1Oh, anything is fine, sweetie. As long as it doesn't bore me!",
	"Tilly_SandyBook.5": "$16Actually, there's a great mystery novel involving carnivorous plants. It's quite long.",
	"Tilly_SandyBook.6": "$1Carnivorous plants? Sounds exciting! Thank you, sweetie.#$b#$b#I'll let you get back to it now.",
	"Tilly_SandyBook.7": "Don't forget to visit soon!",
	
	"Tilly_ClintBook.0": "10 books checked out...",
	"Tilly_ClintBook.1": "Hi, Clint. Welcome to the Museum. How can I help?",
	"Tilly_ClintBook.2": "I have a book to return.",
	"Tilly_ClintBook.3": "$1Ah, thank you.#$b#$17...#$b#Oh! 'Between Two Cacti!'#$b#$1I read this a few years ago. What a love triangle! The ending was so sad.",
	"Tilly_ClintBook.4": "$4Ahem...well, yes. It was a good book.",
	"Tilly_ClintBook.5": "$16The author published the sequel recently. It's just as good.#$b#$16If you'd like to check it out, we have a copy in the Romance section.",
	"Tilly_ClintBook.6": "$2Thanks. Uh, I think I will.",
	"Tilly_ClintBook.7": "*giggle*",
	
	"Tilly_JasBook.0": "See anything you like?",
	"Tilly_JasBook.1": "$3No. I've read all of the books on this shelf!#$b#$4I know, I'll ask Miss Tilly.",
	"Tilly_JasBook.2": "Um, Miss Tilly. Do you think you could help me find a new book to read?#$b#I read all the ones all that shelf over there.",
	"Tilly_JasBook.3": "$16Of course, Jas. We actually have more children's books above the bottom two shelves, although I guess you can't reach those.",
	"Tilly_JasBook.4": "$1Don't worry, I'll ask Gunther for permission to rearrange that area so all the books are accessible for you and Vincent.",
	"Tilly_JasBook.5": "Come, I'll help you find a new book.",
	"Tilly_JasBook.6": "Hmm...",
	"Tilly_JasBook.7": "$16Ah, here's a good one. 'The Land of Fables'.",
	"Tilly_JasBook.8": "$1This was one of my favourite series growing up. I'm sure you'll love it too.",
	"Tilly_JasBook.9": "$1Thank you Miss Tilly!",
	"Tilly_JasBook.10": "$16No problem, Jas. Make sure to check it out at the front.",
	"Tilly_JasBook.11": "Ready to go, Jas?",

	//Joja Consequence

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRoute.0": "$23ARE YOU %*!%*!% KIDDING ME?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRoute.1": "$23I can't believe you would do this. JojaCorp is evil, EVIL.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRoute.2": "$5You're going to corrupt this town. Never, EVER talk to me again.",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRouteDating.0": "$23ARE YOU %*!%*!% KIDDING ME?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRouteDating.1": "$23I can't believe you would do this to me.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRouteDating.2": "$19I thought you understood me. You KNOW that JojaCorp ruined my life.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRouteDating.3": "$5You're going to corrupt this town. Never, EVER talk to me again.",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRouteEngaged.0": "$23ARE YOU %*!%*!% KIDDING ME?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRouteEngaged.1": "$23I can't believe you would do this to me.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRouteEngaged.2": "$19I thought you understood me. You KNOW that JojaCorp ruined my life.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRouteEngaged.3": "$19You can have your pendant back. It obviously means nothing. Goodbye, @.",

	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRouteMarried.0": "$23ARE YOU %*!%*!% KIDDING ME?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRouteMarried.1": "$23I can't believe you would do this to me.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRouteMarried.2": "$19I thought you understood me. I thought you loved me.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRouteMarried.3": "$19You can have your pendant back.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_JojaRouteMarried.4": "$19I'm moving out too. We can't fix this. I can't fix your lack of empathy.",

	//Wedding
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Wedding.1": "$27@...when I first moved here, I was lost. In fact, I thought I did lose everything.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Wedding.2": "$28I didn't think I could get back on my feet, not really. My confidence was shot.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Wedding.3": "$30Thank you for sticking by me, even when I tried to push you away. I know it's not easy getting to know me.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Wedding.4": "$29Thank you for always supporting me and encouraging me, even when I don't believe in myself.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_Wedding.5": "$29You helped me feel whole again. I love you, @.",

	//COMPAT
	
	//Boxosoup Birthday 
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SoupBday.0": "$1Happy birthday, @!#$b#$16Were you surprised? It was quite the task to get everyone here for a party!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SoupBday.1": "$1Alright, everyone. On three! 1...2...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SoupBday.2": "Happy birthday!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SoupBday.3": "'Thank you for the birthday wishes!'",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SoupBday.4": "I'll pass plates around for cake!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_SoupBday.5": "Happy birthday.",
	
	//Merchant 
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Haggle_Ask": "{0}! I've been looking for this book for forever! Umm, how about {1}$ for it?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Haggle_Compromise": "Could you maybe go any lower? Just a litte!$7",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Haggle_Overpriced": "How much?? Sorry, are you serious?$21",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Haggle_Success": "Sold! This will be perfect for the shop. I'll definitely come back to you again!$1",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.Haggle_Fail": "Sorry, this is out of my budget. Maybe next time.$7",
	
	//Darcy Gossip Event
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.DarcyGossip.0": "No way, really?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.DarcyGossip.1": "$16Yeah! Mayor Lewis asked Gunther if there were any informative books on wooing a woman.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.DarcyGossip.2": "I don't think the Museum has any books like that...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.DarcyGossip.3": "$11It doesn't. I told Mayor Lewis to find some magazines.#$b#$1I held myself back from suggesting he call into a radio show.#$b#$16Wouldn't that be funny? I'm not that mean though.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.DarcyGossip.4": "$16Thanks for letting me hang out with you while it rains!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.DarcyGossip.5": "$1You're always welcome to keep me company!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.DarcyGossip.6": "$16Let me buy us two Chocolattes!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.DarcyGossip.7": "$1Coming right up!",
	
	//Shop Strings
	"TeaShop.ClosedMessage": "We're open Mon/Wed/Sat between 9 AM and 5 PM!",
	"TeaShop.Dialogue": "Welcome! What can I get you?",
	
	"LNYStand.ClosedMessage": "We're open between 9 AM to 7 PM today!",
	"LNYStand.Dialogue": "Xin nian kuai le, gong xi fa cai! Please try anything you'd like!",
	
	//LNY
	"LNY.000": "$1Hey, @. Want to try any of these goodies? They're all my favourites.", //Stand schedule string
	"LNY.001": "Hey, I'm just on the phone with my parents. New Year, and all that.#$e#$3Uh, bye.", //Phone call schedule string
	"Fireworks.000": "$16I wish we had sparklers too.#$b#$1They kind of scare me though. What if I burn my fingers?", //Fireworks schedule string
	
	//RSV Events
	"Tilly_IreneBaking.0": "Thanks so much for coming all the way here to make your famous cake with me, Tilly!$1",
	"Tilly_IreneBaking.1": "$16Don't mention it. I know how Madame Maive can be.#$b#$11No disrespect, of course.",
	"Tilly_IreneBaking.2": "Even if her standards are high, it only pushes me to a better chef!#$b#$4Also, Mr. Zayne will be attending Madame's high tea today.",
	"Tilly_IreneBaking.3": "$11So you're doing your very best, huh?",
	"Tilly_IreneBaking.4": "Irene turns even redder.",
	"Tilly_IreneBaking.5": "$4He complimented my experimental dish last time! I'm getting butterflies just thinking about it again.",
	"Tilly_IreneBaking.6": "$1Well, your cooking skill is unrivalled here. Except maybe by Pika.#$b#$11I'll let Zayne know that you did most of the heavy lifting for the cake today.",
	"Tilly_IreneBaking.7": "Miss Irene, Miss Tilly.#$b#Is the cake ready? Madame's guests will arrive shortly.",
	"Tilly_IreneBaking.8": "Oh yes, of course! I'll bring it to the dining room now.",
	"Tilly_IreneBaking.9": "$16We made a testing cake as well. Please feel free to share with the kids!",
	"Tilly_IreneBaking.10": "Thank you, Miss Tilly. Louie will be delighted.",
	"Tilly_IreneBaking.11": "Sure he will be. In his own way...*giggle*",
	"Zayne.Tilly_IreneBakingCT": "I really enjoyed Irene's version of Tilly's Honeycomb Sponge Cake.#$b#She is quite skilled, don't you agree?",

	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.0": "$16I'm so happy we finally got around to creating a book club!",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.1": "Me too!",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.2": "I need an excuse to read more non-academic books...I always put it off.",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.3": "$1I think the first order of business is to decide on a club name. Anyone got ideas?",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.4": "Hmm...",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.5": "Um, how about, 'The PFT Club'?",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.6": "$1Our initials? I like that it makes a pffft sound.",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.7": "What about 'The Sisterbook.' Like a sisterhood? Or is that too silly?",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.8": "$1I'm partial to some wordplay.#$b#$16We can always change it if something else comes along.",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.9": "So, what should we read?",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.10": "I have a few suggestions, but I'm open to more ideas.",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.11": "Let's each suggest one and see which one we're most inclined toward.",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.12": "I'd like to propose 'An Orange, A Clock, and A Goblet.'#$b#$1It's a mystery novel from the 1900's. I've been meaning to read it and I've heard good things!",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.13": "$16What do you suggest, Flor?",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.14": "Oh, well. I thought 'Luminescent' might be a good choice...#$b#$3Unless psychological thrillers aren't your thing!#$b#$4I'm okay with anything! We don't have to read my book.",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.15": "$1No, that sounds interesting!#$b#$16My suggestion is 'A Shotgun Wedding'. It's a satirical play.#$b#$9I thought I'd branch out. I don't read many stageplays.",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.16": "$1I'm not sure about you guys, but I'm having trouble choosing.",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.17": "Me too...",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.18": "Oh, @. Hi!#$b#This is the first meeting of The Sisterbook. A new book club! Today is all about logistics.",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.19": "We're having trouble deciding what book we should read.",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.20": "$q Tilly_RSVBookClub.Q.1 null#What do you think?#$r Tilly_RSVBookClub.Q.1 0 Tilly_RSVBookClub.eventquestion_1#An Orange, A Clock, and A Goblet.#$r Tilly_RSVBookClub.Q.2 0 Tilly_RSVBookClub.eventquestion_2#Luminescent.#$r Tilly_RSVBookClub.Q.3 -0 Tilly_RSVBookClub.eventquestion_3#A Shotgun Wedding.",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.21": "$16It's settled then. Thanks for help, @!#$b#$16Hey, if you want to join us, feel free to!#$b#Sisterbook is open to all. It's really just a bookish mindset.",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.1.22": "Next time, I'll bring some tea and cookies.",
	
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.eventquestion_1": "$16That's Penny's pick. Good choice!#$b#$1We'll be on the edge of our seats.",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.eventquestion_2": "$1Could you tell that was Flor's suggestion?",
	"Tilly_RSVBookClub.eventquestion_3": "$1You picked mine! I'm pretty excited.",


	//PLATONIC ROUTE ALL I18N
	
	//Mail
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete_P.text": "Dear @,^^I knew you were rushing around more than usual! Thank you for donating the construction materials for my shop, and thank you for your endless support. I don't know what I can do to show my gratitude!^^I'm just so excited! Robin said she'll have the shop built quite soon.^^I'll put a little invitation to my grand opening in your mailbox the day before.^^I can't thank you enough! You know this means you have to be my friend forever, right? Bet you weren't expecting that.^^Giddily,^Tilly",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete_P.title": "Best Friends Forever (Mandatory)",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_GrandOpeningMail_P.text": "Dear @,^^Tomorrow's the day! You're invited to the grand opening of my new store, Tilly's Tea Shop!^^Something tells me you'll get a special shoutout. Swing by when I open (9:00 AM sharp).^^Giddily,^Tilly",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_GrandOpeningMail_P.title": "Tilly's Grand Opening",
	
	//Special Order
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.SO_ConstructionOrder_P_Name": "Tilly's New Venture",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly.SO_ConstructionOrder_P_Text": "Help Tilly pursue her dreams of running another business by gathering the construction materials. She'll never see it coming!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_ConstructionOrderObjective_P_Text1": "Deliver 450 Wood to Robin's house.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_ConstructionOrderObjective_P_Text2": "Deliver 200 Stone to Robin's house.",
	
	//Events
	
	//Shop Ponder
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.0_P": "$9Hmm...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.1_P": "$1Oh, @. Hey!#$b#$16Ah, I’m just daydreaming.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.2_P": "About all the tea out there you haven't tried?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.3_P": "$11Not this time.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.4_P": "$7I was daydreaming about my shop. Or I guess, a new shop.#$b#$1I want a little cafe where people can buy tea and relax by reading or studying. Maybe purchase some of my bound books! Do you think it's a bad idea?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.5_P": "Of course not! What’s stopping you?",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.6_P": "The usual. Failure...humiliation...but mostly I’m just nervous about committing to something new.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.7_P": "$1Although, I feel more hopeful than scared.#$b#$1I’m still trying to get used to that feeling, but I'm determined to do this!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.8_P": "$16Robin's been humouring me with some construction plans. She even offered to give me a discount on the renovation if I could source the materials.#$b#$1Maybe I could pay Alex to chop some wood and the like, since Elliott's auction was a huge success.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.Ponder.9_P": "$1Of course I can show you the plans! You can even help with the decor choices, if you'd like.",
	
	//Grand Opening Vanilla
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.0_P": "$1Thank you, everyone, for coming to the grand opening of Tilly's Tea Shop!#$b#$16Sorry it's so crowded. I didn't realize so many people would show up!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.1_P": "$16As everyone knows by now, I came, or fled rather, to Pelican Town after my bookshop was shut down in Zuzu City.#$b#$9I won't name by who.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.2_P": "$16This community has been a haven for me and has become my home.#$b#$17Not just a home away from home, but home.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.3_P": "$1Thank you everyone for your support! I didn't think I'd ever be afforded this opportunity again, but here I am.#$b#$4I'm not the best at expressing these feelings, so I think it might be best we move on.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.4_P": "$16Tilly's Tea Shop is a place where you can sit, relax, have a drink and a sweet treat.#$b#$16The shelves are lined with books you can read at your leisure or purchase to take home.#$b#$1Some books have been rebound by me, and are available for purchase as well!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.5_P": "$1For the grand opening, all drinks and snacks are on the house! Please feel free to stay as long as you'd like and enjoy yourselves!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.6_P": "Lovely!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.7_P": "It smells so good in here...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.8_P": "C'mon Jas!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.9_P": "One moment, Jodi!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.10_P": "Take your time!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.11_P": "$16It's been so hectic, I didn't have a chance to speak with you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.12_P": "$16I just wanted to tell you how much I appreciate you again. This is so surreal!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.13_P": "$11You'll have a permanent discount here, so come by often!#$b#$1Take this cake as an extra little souvenir.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.14_P": "$1See you later, @!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.15_P": "What can I get for you?",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.16_P": "$1Finally, I'd like to give special thanks to @.#$b#$4I'm not one to be so mushy publicly...but I could not have done this without @'s support. Not only emotionally and mentally, but @ was kind enough to supply the construction materials to even build this shop.#$b#$4I'm so lucky to have such an amazing friend.#$b#$1Ahem. Now, please enjoy the grand opening, everyone!",
	
	//Grand Opening SVE
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.0_P": "$1Thank you, everyone, for coming to the grand opening of Tilly's Tea Shop!#$b#$16Sorry it's so crowded. I didn't realize so many people would show up!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.1_P": "$16As everyone knows by now, I came, or fled rather, to Pelican Town after my bookshop was shut down in Zuzu City.#$b#$9I won't name by who.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.2_P": "$16This community has been a haven for me and has become my home.#$b#$17Not just a home away from home, but home.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.3_P": "$1Thank you everyone for your support! I didn't think I'd ever be afforded this opportunity again, but here I am.#$b#$4I'm not the best at expressing these feelings, so I think it might be best we move on.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.4_P": "$16Tilly's Tea Shop is a place where you can sit, relax, have a drink and a sweet treat.#$b#$16The shelves are lined with books you can read at your leisure or purchase to take home.#$b#$1Some books have been rebound by me, and are available for purchase as well!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.5_P": "$1For the grand opening, all drinks and snacks are on the house! Please feel free to stay as long as you'd like and enjoy yourselves!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.6_P": "It smells so good in here...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.7_P": "I hope there's manga...",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.8_P": "C'mon Jas!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.9_P": "One moment, Jodi!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.10_P": "Take your time!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.11_P": "$16It's been so hectic, I didn't have a chance to speak with you.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.12_P": "$16I just wanted to tell you how much I appreciate you again. This is so surreal!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.13_P": "$11You'll have a permanent discount here, so come by often!#$b#$1Take this cake as an extra little souvenir.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.14_P": "$1See you later, @!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.15_P": "What can I get for you?",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpeningSVE.16_P": "$1Finally, I'd like to give special thanks to @.#$b#$4I'm not one to be so mushy publicly...but I could not have done this without @'s support. Not only emotionally and mentally, but @ was kind enough to supply the construction materials to even build this shop.#$b#$4I'm so lucky to have such an amazing friend.#$b#$1Ahem. Now, please enjoy the grand opening, everyone!",
	
	//Fam Intro 
	"Tilly_FamIntro.0_P": "'You look worried.'",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.1_P": "$9Ugh, you could say that.#$b#$17My mom sent me an email. She said she wants to have lunch and spend the day with me.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.2_P": "$3That's not what's gonna happen. I know her.#$b#$8She's going to come, have lunch with me, and spend the entire time trying to get me to go home.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.3_P": "$18No, she definitely won't understand.#$b#$3Ugh, she'll probably bring up that I'm still unmarried.#$b#$9To her, if I don't have a partner here, there's no point in staying.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.4_P": "$7Oh @, that's sweet, but you don't have to drop by during lunch.#$b#$3I'll be fine. Probably.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.5_P": "$3Well, like usual, she didn't send me a date. She's just going to drop in.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.6_P": "$2I really don't want to see her.#$b#$2I mean, I do love her...but I'm happy right now.#$b#$2I don't want my peace to be disturbed.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.7_P": "$2I'm sorry if I'm...even snippier than usual in the coming weeks.#$b#$3I'm just really not looking forward to this.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.8_P": "$1I'm sure you can handle me!#$b#$11We wouldn't have stayed friends for so long if you couldn't.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.9_P": "Anyway...I just hope this goes over fast, and easy.",
	"Tilly_FamIntro.10_P": "Yoba, I can only dream...",
	

	"Tilly_FamVisit.14_P": "$3Landon, stop teasing Matilda.#$b#$1How are you honey?#$b#How are you earning money? This town doesn't seem to have all that much.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.15_P": "I...I'm busy today, Mama.#$b#$8You should visit the aquarium until...5 pm today.",
	
	"Tilly_FamVisit.26_P": "This town is...nice, I suppose. Quaint.#$b#I'm not sure this is the right place for you though, Matilda. How are you going to find an adequate partner here?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.27_P": "$3Don't start, Mama. The people here are wonderful, and I'm still young.#$b#$3I like it here. I'm staying.",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.28_P": "What do you even do every day? Mooch off of whatever friends you have here?",
	
	
	"Tilly_FamVisit.36_P": "You still haven't shown us where you live. Is it a box?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.37_P": "$16Oh, @. Hey! Penny let you know where we were?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.38_P": "Is this the @ you're friends with, Matilda?",
	
	"Tilly_FamVisit.41_P": "$q Tilly_Fam.Q.1 null#$8So @, what do you do for a living? There must not be much opportunity here.#$r Tilly_Fam.Q.1 50 Tilly_Fam.eventquestion_1#I'm an agriculturist, rancher, miner, fisher, and more.#$r Tilly_Fam.Q.2 100 Tilly_Fam.eventquestion_2#I'm a farmer. I own that plot of land to the right of the Bus Stop.#$r Tilly_Fam.Q.3 -100 Tilly_Fam.eventquestion_3#I'm an architect. (Lie).",
	
	"Tilly_FamVisit.42_P": "Hm, well, it all sounds like a lot of labour! Hard work...",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.43_P": "$3Is that a problem, Mama?#$b#$3That the people here aren't engineers like Landon?",
	
	"Tilly_FamVisit.44_P": "*snicker*",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.45_P": "$3You always think the worst of me, Matilda!#$b#I think...a farm is a fine choice.#$b#...As long as you are, ahem, successful?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.46_P": "$3Are you happy? Do you see that life can be good, even if I'm not a lawyer or a doctor?",
	"Tilly_FamVisit.47_P": "It's not the same, Matilda.#$b#$2You need to make something of yourself. And farming might be what @ wants, but it's not what you want.",
	
	"Tilly_FamVisit.62_P": "$2Listen Mama. I am happy here. I have friends that support me, and I don't mean financially.#$b#$26@ in particular gave me the confidence to open another shop, and I've never been happier.#$b#$2You just...you and dad never understood me.#$b#$2This is what I love doing, even if I'm not going to super wealthy on my own.",
	
	"Tilly_FamVisit.68_P": "$1Thank you for being a good friend to Matilda, @.#$b#$2We haven't been the best support system in recent years, so I'm happy she had you.",
	
	
	
	//JOJA ROUTE ALL I18N
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_GrandOpeningMailJoja.text": "Dear @,^^Tomorrow's the day! You're invited to the grand opening of my new store, Tilly's Tea Shop!^^Swing by when I open (9:00 AM sharp).^^- Tilly",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_GrandOpeningMailJoja.title": "Tilly's Grand Opening",
	
	//SO 
	"Tilly.SO_ConstructionOrderJoja_Text": "Helping Tilly is the right thing to do. Don't let Joja Corporation think it can run this town without intereference!",

	//Events
	
	//Morris Bribe
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.0": "@, why are you here?$8",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.1": "$3Okay...#$b#$3What do you want, Morris?",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.2": "No need for the attitude, Miss Tilly.#$b#$1I have a proposition for you.",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.3": "$3Why would I want anything from you? And why would you want to proposition me for anything?#$b#$5I have nothing left to give you!",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.4": "As a show of good faith from Joja Corporation...#$b#(And to get you to stop sending me death glares whenever I leave the building...)",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.5": "$5Excuse me?",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.6": "Ahem.#$b#$1I have calculated the profits you would have reaped had your little bookstore in Zuzu City stayed open since it closed, and Joja Corporation is happy to pay you the full amount.#$b#In exchange for your patronage. That's more than generous, wouldn't you agree?",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.7": "$5You must be out of your mind, Morris! Are you serious?",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.8": "$1It is quite unbelievable isn't it? How kind of headquarters!",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.9": "$3Why are you here for this conversation, @?",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.10": "$q Tilly_Bribe.Q.1 null#Was this your idea or something?#$r Tilly_Bribe.Q.1 0 Tilly_Bribe.eventquestion_1#Yes, it's a lot of money. It can help you get back on your feet. Even open a new store!#$r Tilly_Bribe.Q.2 0 Tilly_Bribe.eventquestion_2#No, but it's a lot of money. I think it could help you get back on your feet. Even open a new store!",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.11": "Well let's not be hasty about a new store...",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.12": "$5Why? Do you think I'll be competition?",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.13": "Hardly. But why would I want to prolong this...feud between us? I'm a nice man, Tilly.#$b#$1Face it. Joja Corporation is unbeatable. It would be best not to get in our way.",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.14": "$5We'll see about that!",
	
	//Morris Bribe SVE
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.SVE.6": "Ahem.#$b#$1I have calculated the profits you would have reaped had your bookstore in Zuzu City stayed open since it closed, and Joja Corporation is happy to pay you the full amount.",

	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.SVE.8": "$2I'm sorry, I thought this would be a good resolution for us.",

	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.SVE.13": "Hardly. But why would I want to prolong this...feud between us?#$b#$2While I am trying to repair Joja Corporation's relationship with this town...I'm unable to simply stop corporate from competing with you despite my own feelings.#$b#$2I'm not sure your new store will survive. Joja Corporation is formidable, whether you like it or not.",
	"Tilly_MorrisBribe.SVE.14": "$5We'll see about that!#$b#$3If you really wanted to help this town, you would be less cynical and more cooperative.",
	
	//Joja Plans 
	"Tilly_JojaPlans.0": "$17Hm?#$b#$8Oh, it's you.#$b#$17I'm just trying to organize my plans to open a new shop.",
	"Tilly_JojaPlans.1": "$3I don't know if it's a good idea, but I don't want to let Joja Corporation hold me back from what I want to do with my life.#$b#$17Don't worry, you've already made your allegience clear.",
	"Tilly_JojaPlans.2": "'I didn't mean to side with Joja...but it was in exchange for town improvements. Isn't that good?'",
	"Tilly_JojaPlans.3": "$17I'm not going to let Joja buy out this town. Are you?#$b#$8I'm going to show them that we're strong and we won't succumb to them just because they did a few good deeds.#$b#$17You can help me or stay on the sidelines, but I am determined to prove Morris wrong.#$b#$17I was naive before, but I'm stronger now. And I have friends who will support me.",
	"Tilly_JojaPlans.4": "'What can I do?'",
	"Tilly_JojaPlans.5": "$17If you really want to help...I suppose you could gather the construction materials Robin will actually need to build my shop.#$b#$8Don't worry. I'll pay.",
	"Tilly_JojaPlans.6": "It's a start! Maybe Tilly will warm up to you again soon.",
	"Tilly_JojaPlans.7": "You better not sabotage me and the town.",
	"Tilly_JojaPlans.8": "...or it'll take a bit more work.",
	
	//Construction Order Complete 
	"Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete.Joja.0": "$8Um, good morning, @.#$b#$8Robin notified me that you actually supplied the construction materials.",
	"Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete.Joja.1": "Well, I came to pay you for the help.",
	"Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete.Joja.2": "$7What do you mean, 'no'?#$b#$3I said I would pay you. I don't want any pity.",
	"Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete.Joja.3": "'I want to do what I can to help because I believe in you.'",
	"Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete.Joja.4": "'You should use that money to get ready for the store opening. Show JojaCorp your full strength.'",
	"Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete.Joja.5": "'I live here too. Before, I thought I was doing what was best for Pelican Town...and now I believe this is what is best.'",
	"Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete.Joja.6": "$8I guess it wouldn't be fair of me to shut down your attempts to rectify things between us.#$b#$17I struggle with holding grudges, as you can tell.#$b#$8But...this is a huge help. I could definitely put the funds toward advertising, more recipe testing, stocking up on ingredients...",
	"Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete.Joja.7": "I'm not sure I fully forgive you yet...but thank you. This is thoughtful.",
	"Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete.Joja.8": "$8Oh, I'm not sure when Robin will build the store yet.#$b#I think I'll drum up some more excitement for the store before I give the go ahead.#$b#$16In any case, I'll invite you to the grand opening.",
	"Tilly_ConstructionOrderComplete.Joja.9": "See you. Thanks again.",
	
	//Advertising in Town Square
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.0": "Tilly's Tea Shop, coming soon!",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.1": "$1Well, isn't this precious.#$b#I'm surprised you're actually going through with it, Miss Tilly.",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.2": "$3You shouldn't be surprised. You'll see.",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.3": "$1Then you won't mind if I do some advertising myself here.",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.4": "Whatever.",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.5": "$1Caroline, Jas, hello!",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.6": "Hi Tilly, what's all this?",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.7": "$16I'm planning to open a new shop in town. Tilly's Tea Shop!",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.8": "$1A tea shop? I'm intrigued!",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.9": "Why Caroline, why don't you take a coupon for JojaMart?#$b#$1We have quite a large selection of tea.",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.10": "$2Morris, I haven't yet shopped at JojaMart. A coupon isn't going to change my mind.#$b#$1Besides, I know Tilly's tea will taste much better than whatever is stocked in JojaMart.",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.11": "Exactly!",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.12": "Um, Miss Tilly, what else will there be at your store?",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.13": "$1I'm glad you asked, Jas.#$b#$16I'll be stocking the store with a lot of books you can read and buy.#$b#$1Plus, I'll be selling lots of yummy snacks.",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.14": "We can move some of our classes to Tilly's shop when it opens.#$b#Would you like that Jas?",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.15": "Yes please! I'm going to tell Vincent the good news!",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.16": "Hmm...",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.17": "$11Getting nervous, Morris?",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.18": "This display poses no threat. I'm not entirely confident you'll even commit in the end.",
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.19": "Don't get your hopes up.",
	
	//Advertising in Town Square SVE
	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.SVE.1": "I'm surprised you're actually going through with it, Miss Tilly.#$b#$2I commend your determination, but I still think it's futile to try and compete with Joja Corporation. Especially without my help!",

	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.SVE.3": "$1Then you won't mind if I do some advertising myself here.#$b#$1I still have to do my job, after all.",

	"Tilly_AdvertisingBattle.SVE.18": "Only for you, Miss Tilly.#$b#And I'm not entirely confident you'll even commit in the end.",
	
	//Ad Montage
	"Tilly_AdMontage.0": "Tilly's been busy spreading the word about her new shop!",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.1": "$16...and I've brought some free samples of the cakes and pastries I'll be selling at my shop.#$b#$1To refuel after aerobics of course!",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.2": "Oh, they certainly look better than Joja's items...healthier too.",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.3": "This isn't a ploy to get you out of the house more, Seb.#$b#$11I just happen to be planning to have Solarion Chronicles and other games at my shop.",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.4": "Sick!",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.5": "Sam's easy to please. He'll drag me there, probably...",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.6": "You just can't beat Joja's prices, kid!",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.7": "$16Oh come on, Pam. You know my products will taste better.#$b#$16Penny will bring some home and you'll see!",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.8": "I only like Joja cola. Not any of that tea or healthy crap.",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.9": "$16At least stop by for some sweets.",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.10": "I don't like sweets.",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.11": "Not as much luck here.",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.12": "But Tilly's not worried. Not when she has support!",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.13": "Are these ingredients for your shop?#$b#Let me give you a discount.",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.14": "I just can't stand JojaMart...or Morris.",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.15": "What about a star-shaped cookie, dear?",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.16": "Good idea!",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.17": "Unique but simple logo...",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.18": "Miss Tilly said she wants a book wishlist from us.",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.19": "What do you think about this menu, Penny?",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.20": "I like it!#$b#You're just missing Maple Bars. It's an easy way to lure at least Sam in.",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.21": "This wallpaper will be perfect. And these rugs...",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.22": "Ah, these are essential reads.",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.23": "I'm really excited. The kids will really like the change of scenery and I've never had a lot of the things on your menu!",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.24": "$1Make good use of your friends discount! I promise everything will be delicious.",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.25": "$16I'm nearly ready to open. Thank you guys for all your help!#$b#$1It means the world to me.",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.26": "Even me and Jas?",
	"Tilly_AdMontage.27": "Of course!",
	
	
	//Grand Opening 
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.0_Joja": "$1Thank you, everyone, for coming to the grand opening of Tilly's Tea Shop!#$b#$16Sorry it's so crowded. I'm so grateful for this turnout!",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.1_Joja": "$16As everyone knows by now, I came, or fled rather, to Pelican Town after my bookshop was shut down in Zuzu City.#$b#$1Today I stand here, proud to have opened a new shop despite the presence of Joja Corporation. In spite of, too.",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.3_Joja": "$1Thank you everyone for your support! I didn't think I'd ever be afforded this opportunity again, but here I am.#$b#$16I am confident that we can be strong together and ensure that our town will not become another conquest for Joja Corporation.#$b#$2It's really quite touching how many people pitched in to help get this shop up and running.#$b#$1I'm so grateful to all of you.#$b#$4Ahem. I'm not the best at expressing these feelings, so I think it might be best we move on.",

	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.12_Joja": "$16I just wanted to tell you that things are good between us.#$b#$1You showed how much you really care about Pelican Town, just like I do.#$b#$11Even if it took a couple missteps to get here.",
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.13_Joja": "$11I might still change my mind though, so come by often!",
	
	"Wem.Bundle.Tilly_12H.GrandOpening.16_Joja": "$16I know I can't offer the same low prices as JojaMart, but I promise that you can't get the same quality there.#$b#$16Please continue to support all of our local businesses after today.#$b#$1Now, please enjoy the grand opening, everyone!",
	
	
	//Morris Defeated, Vanilla 
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.0": "Vincent can't get enough of your cookies.",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.1": "So this is why our sales have been down...",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.2": "Well, sir, let me explain...",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.3": "$2The new shop that one of the townsfolk opened up is...succeeding.#$b#$3I would never have anticipated this!#$b#$3...#$b#$3I have tried giving out coupons for our tea and pastries, but no one uses them except a couple people!#$b#$3And those individuals do not buy much tea nor pastries.",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.4": "*We're losing money, Morris!*",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.5": "$3Sir, I think we should simply stop stocking those items.#$b#$3I...I am not confident we can compete with her.",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.6": "'We're Joja Corporation! How are you letting a rinky dink shop outsell you?'",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.7": "$3I'm sorry sir. I underestimated this town.#$b#$3We might need to rethink our strategy.",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.8": "Joja Corporation seems to have no plans to leave Pelican Town, but the town's spirit is reinforced.",
	
	//Morris Defeated, SVE
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.Joja.3": "$2The new shop that one of the townsfolk opened up is quite successful.#$b#I have tried giving out coupons for our tea and pastries, but no one uses them except a couple people!#$b#$3And those individuals do not buy much tea nor pastries.",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.Joja.4": "*So what do we do, Morris?*",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.Joja.5": "Sir, I think we should simply stop stocking those items.#$b#To be honest, I do not think it's a good idea to continue competing with the local businesses. I have felt this for a while now, and the numbers don't lie.#$b#To thrive in Pelican Town, we should be providing what the people here do not already sell.#$b#We underestimated how strong this community is.",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.Joja.6": "'We're Joja Corporation! How are you letting a rinky dink shop outsell you?'",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.Joja.7": "Ahem. I am simply saying that our strategy needs to change.#$b#$1Success can be achieved, but these small towns are a unique challenge.#$b#It is not useful to fight against potential customers. The only potential customers in the area.#$b#$1We need to work with the town, not against them.",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.Joja.8": "'...I'll see you when we meet next month. Bring evidence that your revised strategy is promising.'",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.Joja.9": "*click!*",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.Joja.10": "$1Win-win for all...",
	"Tilly_MorrisDefeated.Joja.11": "Joja Corporation seems to have no plans to leave Pelican Town, but the future seems brighter now.",
	
	//CT Dialogue
	"Tilly.jojaEmporium": "Hmph, I won't be shopping at the Joja Emporium.$3#$b#$11There's no overlap between my items and theirs though. So I can give them just a smidge of grace.#$e#$1Not that their items could beat mine in taste and quality, anyway.",
	"Tilly.election": "$5I can't express how disappointed I am that Morris won!#$b#$5I don't trust him. No one should.#$e#$14Please leave me alone. I'm...I don't want to talk to anyone right now.",

	
	"Tilly.Tilly_JojaOpeningBuffer": "$3I'm done being scared of Joja Corporation.#$b#$11When I succeed, Morris is going to eat his words.",
	"Tilly.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "$1The opening was such a success!#$b#$16I feel unfamiliarly optimistic about the future.",

	"Emily.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "Do you like the design of Tilly's Tea Shop?#$b#$1I helped her, of course!",
	"Haley.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "I finally got to try a Matcha Latte.#$e#$1It's yummy.",
	"Penny.Tilly_JojaOpeningBuffer": "I'm hoping to convince Mom to drink more tea.#$b#$1I'll need to bring her to Tilly's new store often.",
	"Penny.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "Tilly was kind enough to set up a spot for me and the kids at her store.",
	"Sebastian.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "Sam has been bugging me to play Solarion Chronicles at Tilly's shop.",
	"Evelyn.Tilly_JojaOpeningBuffer": "Make sure to stop by Tilly's new shop, dear.#$b#I helped her develop some of the recipes for her pastries.",
	"Evelyn.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "George quite enjoys sitting in front of Tilly's fireplace.",
	"Elliott.Tilly_JojaOpeningBuffer": "Tilly has taken many of my book suggestions for her selection.#$b#$1I am eagerly anticipating the opening of her store.",
	"Elliott.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "I wonder if Tilly would put my novel on her shelves.",
	"Pam.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "Tea? A pale ale is better.#$b#And nothing beats Gus's pale ale.",
	"Jas.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "I feel like a grown-up drinking tea at Miss Tilly's shop.",
	"Vincent.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "I like Miss Tilly's Star Cookies. They taste better because of the shape! It's true!",
	"Jodi.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "I've tried brewing JojaMart tea for Kent, but he hates the taste.#$b#I'm glad Tilly opened her shop, even if it's a bit pricier than what I'm used to at Joja.",
	"Shane.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "Jas dragged me into Tilly's shop the other day.#$e#I had a sip of Jas's tea. It was...whatever.",
	"Pierre.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "Tilly's shop opening means more business for me.#$b#$1I couldn't be happier!",
	"Lewis.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "The local economy is flourishing and the town's future seems to be more secure.#$b#I'll need to speak with Tilly about taxation!",
	"Harvey.Tilly_DefeatedBuffer": "$1I have no excuse to not try and curb my coffee habit now.",

}
